(3175735, 444805, 30982, '<td valign="top">Neat old building and very nice job getting bot the fence and building in focus.</td>', 'Neat old building and very nice job getting bot the fence and building in focus.', '2007-01-03 12:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3175736, 445746, 43073, '<td valign="top">Photos with the main subject(s) in silhouette often do not work for me, and this fits in that category. It''s a personal preference, and here the silhouette  is light enough to allow some whites to show, but not much more. That the horse is behind the fence is very difficult to pick up, but seems relevant to the subject matter (and the challenge).</td>', 'Photos with the main subject(s) in silhouette often do not work for me, and this fits in that category. It''s a personal preference, and here the silhouette  is light enough to allow some whites to show, but not much more. That the horse is behind the fence is very difficult to pick up, but seems relevant to the subject matter (and the challenge).', '2007-01-03 12:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3175740, 444937, 43073, '<td valign="top">Not relevant enough to the challenge for me, though it has some very nice qualities, and the lighting is quite interesting (in a good way).</td>', 'Not relevant enough to the challenge for me, though it has some very nice qualities, and the lighting is quite interesting (in a good way).', '2007-01-03 12:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3175745, 446531, 30982, '<td valign="top">A peaceful scene.  You may have overdone the red a bit on the horse - looks a tad unnatural.  Still, I like the basic photograph just fine.</td>', 'A peaceful scene.  You may have overdone the red a bit on the horse - looks a tad unnatural.  Still, I like the basic photograph just fine.', '2007-01-03 13:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3175748, 446524, 43073, '<td valign="top">The lack of sharp focus on the foreground fence leaves me thinking it''s not the subject of the photo (but it was the subject of the challenge); the sky is also a bit too bright for me, and some contrast/brightness/saturation post-processing seems called for here.</td>', 'The lack of sharp focus on the foreground fence leaves me thinking it''s not the subject of the photo (but it was the subject of the challenge); the sky is also a bit too bright for me, and some contrast/brightness/saturation post-processing seems called for here.', '2007-01-03 13:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3175749, 444652, 5792, '<td valign="top">Looks like Portland, Oregon. Is it?<br/> <br/>Nicely captured... Good shadows and perspective.</td>', 'Looks like Portland, Oregon. Is it? Nicely captured... Good shadows and perspective.', '2007-01-03 13:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3175750, 446226, 34337, '<td valign="top">pretty good editing job with the blur.</td>', 'pretty good editing job with the blur.', '2007-01-03 13:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3175751, 445228, 43073, '<td valign="top">The negative effect here did not work for me; I would have much preferred to see the non-negative version.</td>', 'The negative effect here did not work for me; I would have much preferred to see the non-negative version.', '2007-01-03 13:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3175752, 446543, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice line/angle chosen for this shot, and nice background.  Not sure why you chose to desat it, though - I think it would probably be just as good in full color.</td>', 'Very nice line/angle chosen for this shot, and nice background.  Not sure why you chose to desat it, though - I think it would probably be just as good in full color.', '2007-01-03 13:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3175757, 446179, 43073, '<td valign="top">The composition here was very confusing to me, and I wasn''t quite sure where the subject was. Very busy, without a clear focus area on which to concentrate. Watch what''s behind your subject (assuming that here it''s the fence).</td>', 'The composition here was very confusing to me, and I wasn''t quite sure where the subject was. Very busy, without a clear focus area on which to concentrate. Watch what''s behind your subject (assuming that here it''s the fence).', '2007-01-03 13:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3175758, 445305, 43774, '<td valign="top">Oh what a neat fence!!!</td>', 'Oh what a neat fence!!!', '2007-01-03 13:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3175762, 445202, 34337, '<td valign="top">great colors.  contrast is good, but mabye just a bit too high, judging by the shoe.</td>', 'great colors.  contrast is good, but mabye just a bit too high, judging by the shoe.', '2007-01-03 13:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3175767, 444579, 43073, '<td valign="top">The blue overtones to everything here did not work for me; was the snow really blue to the naked eye? Was the tree/bush on the right really purple? The pastel effect was just a bit too much for me to take.</td>', 'The blue overtones to everything here did not work for me; was the snow really blue to the naked eye? Was the tree/bush on the right really purple? The pastel effect was just a bit too much for me to take.', '2007-01-03 13:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3175782, 446289, 43073, '<td valign="top">Subject matter here was not particularly interesting to me, and while suitably shot, there''s nothing special or different about the appearance of objects with which we''re all familiar.</td>', 'Subject matter here was not particularly interesting to me, and while suitably shot, there''s nothing special or different about the appearance of objects with which we''re all familiar.', '2007-01-03 13:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3175783, 445711, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice handling of the light and shadowed areas.  Good choice for the challenge as well.</td>', 'Very nice handling of the light and shadowed areas.  Good choice for the challenge as well.', '2007-01-03 13:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3175787, 444256, 43073, '<td valign="top">The subject matter here didn''t do anything for me; close focus on the center of a piece of cable; I found the background distracting, and what was in the foreground not of enough interest.</td>', 'The subject matter here didn''t do anything for me; close focus on the center of a piece of cable; I found the background distracting, and what was in the foreground not of enough interest.', '2007-01-03 13:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3175794, 443763, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good strong lines but might have benefitted from a deeper DOF to get at least the nearer side of the hill sharper.</td>', 'Good strong lines but might have benefitted from a deeper DOF to get at least the nearer side of the hill sharper.', '2007-01-03 13:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3175796, 444880, 68648, '<td valign="top">????</td>', '????', '2007-01-03 13:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3175798, 446299, 43073, '<td valign="top">The subject matter here really didn''t fit the challenge for me, and wasn''t particularly interesting to me. Actually, the arrangement itself is somewhat garish (blue, two yellows, green, two blues); nothing holds the whole thing together, and the cars at the end of the row are an unnecessary distraction (I would have cropped them out and ended the shot there).</td>', 'The subject matter here really didn''t fit the challenge for me, and wasn''t particularly interesting to me. Actually, the arrangement itself is somewhat garish (blue, two yellows, green, two blues); nothing holds the whole thing together, and the cars at the end of the row are an unnecessary distraction (I would have cropped them out and ended the shot there).', '2007-01-03 13:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3175802, 446359, 30982, '<td valign="top">I really quite like this one - like the B&amp;W and the choice of subject matter.  Busy in a good way!</td>', 'I really quite like this one - like the B&W and the choice of subject matter.  Busy in a good way!', '2007-01-03 13:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3175803, 445037, 43073, '<td valign="top">silhouetted primary subjects often don''t do much for me, and this fits within that personal preference. The shadow doesn''t provide enough detail to see what otherwise might be interesting parts of the scene.</td>', 'silhouetted primary subjects often don''t do much for me, and this fits within that personal preference. The shadow doesn''t provide enough detail to see what otherwise might be interesting parts of the scene.', '2007-01-03 13:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3175806, 446256, 43073, '<td valign="top">Wasn''t sure why you chose focus as you did, or what I should be "seeing" (not physically but as in what it is intended to say). So, the subject matter and teh composition just didn''t work for me.</td>', 'Wasn''t sure why you chose focus as you did, or what I should be "seeing" (not physically but as in what it is intended to say). So, the subject matter and teh composition just didn''t work for me.', '2007-01-03 13:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3175807, 445001, 30982, '<td valign="top">Love the hazy distance - adds an aura of isolation to this - but not abandonment since the flag is too new and clean.  Nice.</td>', 'Love the hazy distance - adds an aura of isolation to this - but not abandonment since the flag is too new and clean.  Nice.', '2007-01-03 13:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3175812, 446129, 43073, '<td valign="top">The subject matter just didn''t do it for me here; the composition doesn''t bring anything to my attention, and I''m not sure what you saw that you were hoping I would see.</td>', 'The subject matter just didn''t do it for me here; the composition doesn''t bring anything to my attention, and I''m not sure what you saw that you were hoping I would see.', '2007-01-03 13:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3175814, 444929, 43073, '<td valign="top">I don''t buy these as fences, and so it seems a bit out of the challenge for me.</td>', 'I don''t buy these as fences, and so it seems a bit out of the challenge for me.', '2007-01-03 13:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3175819, 446582, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice tones and detail.  Something about it makes me want to see more at the top, though.</td>', 'Very nice tones and detail.  Something about it makes me want to see more at the top, though.', '2007-01-03 13:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3175821, 443976, 43073, '<td valign="top">The fence here looks really interesting, breaking a bit, but it''s not featured enough for me to really see it, and the pale, over-all purplish shading was generally not for me.</td>', 'The fence here looks really interesting, breaking a bit, but it''s not featured enough for me to really see it, and the pale, over-all purplish shading was generally not for me.', '2007-01-03 13:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3175822, 443390, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice color - rich and warm.  Good use of the rule of thirds.  You maybe oughta fix the gate.</td>', 'Nice color - rich and warm.  Good use of the rule of thirds.  You maybe oughta fix the gate.', '2007-01-03 13:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3175824, 444521, 43073, '<td valign="top">This seems to be more a shot of a cheetah than a shot of a fence, and the over-bright whites undermine even this aspect of the photo.</td>', 'This seems to be more a shot of a cheetah than a shot of a fence, and the over-bright whites undermine even this aspect of the photo.', '2007-01-03 13:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3175828, 446417, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very very nice.  Would love to hear this is a candid but I suspect it was carefully planned and executed.  Softness in both texture, focus and color works very well here.</td>', 'Very very nice.  Would love to hear this is a candid but I suspect it was carefully planned and executed.  Softness in both texture, focus and color works very well here.', '2007-01-03 13:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3175829, 445714, 43073, '<td valign="top">While an interesting rhetorical twist, I''d much prefer to see this done for another challenge, and see your perspective on something more physically and less metaphorically a fence.</td>', 'While an interesting rhetorical twist, I''d much prefer to see this done for another challenge, and see your perspective on something more physically and less metaphorically a fence.', '2007-01-03 13:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3175830, 445872, 43073, '<td valign="top">I have no idea how this addresses the challenge.</td>', 'I have no idea how this addresses the challenge.', '2007-01-03 13:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3175834, 446400, 37529, '<td valign="top">Lots of rustic charm in that old fence.  Focus is tack sharp and the colors are vibrant.  Not sure I like that guano highlights though. 8</td>', 'Lots of rustic charm in that old fence.  Focus is tack sharp and the colors are vibrant.  Not sure I like that guano highlights though. 8', '2007-01-03 13:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3175840, 446681, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very stark - feels cold and forbidding!</td>', 'Very stark - feels cold and forbidding!', '2007-01-03 13:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3175847, 444976, 30982, '<td valign="top">I love mottled shadows like this but it''s awfully hard to convey them in pictures.  Kind of needs a bit of a central something to draw the eye at least initially.</td>', 'I love mottled shadows like this but it''s awfully hard to convey them in pictures.  Kind of needs a bit of a central something to draw the eye at least initially.', '2007-01-03 13:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3175850, 446402, 37529, '<td valign="top">I like the way the fence brings you in and then takes you back out again.  Excellent composition.  Nice scenery too. 9</td>', 'I like the way the fence brings you in and then takes you back out again.  Excellent composition.  Nice scenery too. 9', '2007-01-03 13:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3175852, 446431, 30982, '<td valign="top">Beautimous!  How did you get your background to be so durn perfect for the shot?  Very nicely done.</td>', 'Beautimous!  How did you get your background to be so durn perfect for the shot?  Very nicely done.', '2007-01-03 13:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3175856, 444926, 30982, '<td valign="top">Simple, pleasing composition - nice choice for the challenge.</td>', 'Simple, pleasing composition - nice choice for the challenge.', '2007-01-03 13:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3175867, 446553, 69934, '<td valign="top">this is beautiful, great colors, nice shadows</td>', 'this is beautiful, great colors, nice shadows', '2007-01-03 13:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3175888, 444880, 35106, '<td valign="top">Too Dark</td>', 'Too Dark', '2007-01-03 13:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3175934, 446685, 13207, '<td valign="top">Great color, good subject, but poor post-processing - around the fence posts I can see where you missed with the blur, especially the two middle ones.</td>', 'Great color, good subject, but poor post-processing - around the fence posts I can see where you missed with the blur, especially the two middle ones.', '2007-01-03 13:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
