(3176041, 443763, 70375, '<td valign="top">It''s intriguing! I would like to see just a bit more of the fence leaving though... beautiful colors, nice clarity.</td>', 'It''s intriguing! I would like to see just a bit more of the fence leaving though... beautiful colors, nice clarity.', '2007-01-03 14:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
