(3176051, 446584, 6804, '<td valign="top">Excellent rural composition!!!  I love the background against the clean clear subject.  Very nice work.  I would love to see this as a black/white as well.  10</td>', 'Excellent rural composition!!!  I love the background against the clean clear subject.  Very nice work.  I would love to see this as a black/white as well.  10', '2007-01-03 14:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
