(3176118, 445404, 6804, '<td valign="top">This is my kind of shot.  I love images that can aesthetically break the rules of composition.  The centered post works well with the lead-lines and the wagon positioned for balance.  I know the DOF is intentional but because of the strong lead-lines to the wagon, it might help your score some to include the wagon within the focal range.  This will make a great Black/white as well.  High marks from me.</td>', 'This is my kind of shot.  I love images that can aesthetically break the rules of composition.  The centered post works well with the lead-lines and the wagon positioned for balance.  I know the DOF is intentional but because of the strong lead-lines to the wagon, it might help your score some to include the wagon within the focal range.  This will make a great Black/white as well.  High marks from me.', '2007-01-03 14:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
