(3176484, 446718, 66693, '<td valign="top">I really like this concept.  I wonder if you could have included just a little bit more of the sky?  To me the color of the ocean/sky in the background really compliments the bleak grey ''winter'' of the sand and fence.</td>', 'I really like this concept.  I wonder if you could have included just a little bit more of the sky?  To me the color of the ocean/sky in the background really compliments the bleak grey ''winter'' of the sand and fence.', '2007-01-03 15:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176501, 444785, 69121, '<td valign="top">So it''s a ladder and not a fence? And you are admitting to it?</td>', 'So it''s a ladder and not a fence? And you are admitting to it?', '2007-01-03 15:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176507, 446591, 66693, '<td valign="top">I like the choice of subject matter, but my eye keeps being drawn to the gate and the silver post.  The lack of focus in that part of the image was probably intentional but to me it is distracting.  Maybe if you tried from another angle??</td>', 'I like the choice of subject matter, but my eye keeps being drawn to the gate and the silver post.  The lack of focus in that part of the image was probably intentional but to me it is distracting.  Maybe if you tried from another angle??', '2007-01-03 15:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176514, 445302, 66693, '<td valign="top">The splash of color amid the grey is appealing and the ''fence'' is there but not the focus of the image.  Nicely done.</td>', 'The splash of color amid the grey is appealing and the ''fence'' is there but not the focus of the image.  Nicely done.', '2007-01-03 15:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176543, 446632, 61222, '<td valign="top">Love the colors :-) and the way the horse is following the fence line</td>', 'Love the colors :-) and the way the horse is following the fence line', '2007-01-03 15:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176549, 445781, 68648, '<td valign="top">the only thing I don''t like about this is the bowing due to the wide angle!  (or is the fence warped?!)  :)</td>', 'the only thing I don''t like about this is the bowing due to the wide angle!  (or is the fence warped?!)  :)', '2007-01-03 15:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176551, 446750, 68648, '<td valign="top">very atmospheric!</td>', 'very atmospheric!', '2007-01-03 15:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176555, 446554, 66693, '<td valign="top">Good color.  The bokeh effect is nice; not too overpowering.  And I really like the combination of old and new wire.  It looks like there is at least three distinct generations of fencing there.</td>', 'Good color.  The bokeh effect is nice; not too overpowering.  And I really like the combination of old and new wire.  It looks like there is at least three distinct generations of fencing there.', '2007-01-03 15:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176556, 446383, 68648, '<td valign="top">fantastic!  the ice crystals "make" the shot....(spikes on top of spikes)....not sure about the background - glad it is so defocused, but still a bit busy....</td>', 'fantastic!  the ice crystals "make" the shot....(spikes on top of spikes)....not sure about the background - glad it is so defocused, but still a bit busy....', '2007-01-03 15:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176558, 445338, 68648, '<td valign="top">simple elegance!</td>', 'simple elegance!', '2007-01-03 15:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176578, 445760, 69387, '<td valign="top">I wish I could see more of the fence</td>', 'I wish I could see more of the fence', '2007-01-03 15:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176586, 445402, 69387, '<td valign="top">I like this photo. I wish I saw a little more detail of the creature behind the fence.</td>', 'I like this photo. I wish I saw a little more detail of the creature behind the fence.', '2007-01-03 15:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176593, 443526, 69387, '<td valign="top">I wish this photo was crisper. Good subject!</td>', 'I wish this photo was crisper. Good subject!', '2007-01-03 15:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176595, 445489, 66693, '<td valign="top">Nice angle, makes you feel as if it would collapse at any moment.</td>', 'Nice angle, makes you feel as if it would collapse at any moment.', '2007-01-03 15:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176597, 445763, 69387, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! I wish this photo was crisper.</td>', 'Beautiful! I wish this photo was crisper.', '2007-01-03 15:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176598, 446750, 69387, '<td valign="top">Nice!</td>', 'Nice!', '2007-01-03 15:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176601, 446697, 66693, '<td valign="top">very interesting perspective.</td>', 'very interesting perspective.', '2007-01-03 15:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176602, 446629, 69387, '<td valign="top">Very nice detail. The green background doesn''t work much for the subject, in my opinion, it actually distracts me.</td>', 'Very nice detail. The green background doesn''t work much for the subject, in my opinion, it actually distracts me.', '2007-01-03 15:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176610, 446656, 69387, '<td valign="top">Nice! I''m not a big fan of sepia hues, but this one is beautiful!</td>', 'Nice! I''m not a big fan of sepia hues, but this one is beautiful!', '2007-01-03 15:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176615, 444239, 35994, '<td valign="top">Aww! How cute!! I love cows! Great detail in the face, looks like she almost stuck her tongue out at you, nice shot!</td>', 'Aww! How cute!! I love cows! Great detail in the face, looks like she almost stuck her tongue out at you, nice shot!', '2007-01-03 15:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176625, 444601, 69387, '<td valign="top">Awesome composition and great processing! I love the effect.</td>', 'Awesome composition and great processing! I love the effect.', '2007-01-03 15:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176627, 446620, 61222, '<td valign="top">Sorry I don''t see a fence in this image</td>', 'Sorry I don''t see a fence in this image', '2007-01-03 15:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176634, 446195, 69387, '<td valign="top">this is beautiful</td>', 'this is beautiful', '2007-01-03 15:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176643, 446080, 66693, '<td valign="top">When I set out to do this challenge I swore I was not going to shoot a ''chain link'' fence.... too DULL!  This is a good shot.  I almost feel imprisoned.  That fence is the only thing standing between me and all the rest of the world.  And the light reflecting off the wire works well for you.  Congratulations... you won me over.</td>', 'When I set out to do this challenge I swore I was not going to shoot a ''chain link'' fence.... too DULL!  This is a good shot.  I almost feel imprisoned.  That fence is the only thing standing between me and all the rest of the world.  And the light reflecting off the wire works well for you.  Congratulations... you won me over.', '2007-01-03 15:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176647, 446615, 26001, '<td valign="top">very nice use of high contrast.</td>', 'very nice use of high contrast.', '2007-01-03 16:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176648, 446416, 66693, '<td valign="top">To me the light on the horses face is just a little too harsh.</td>', 'To me the light on the horses face is just a little too harsh.', '2007-01-03 16:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176652, 446418, 26001, '<td valign="top">whats up with the trees in this shot? did you do some pp?</td>', 'whats up with the trees in this shot? did you do some pp?', '2007-01-03 16:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176660, 445783, 66693, '<td valign="top">Nice shot... the black and white works well for the subject matter.  I shot several ''cemetary'' fences that didn''t make the cut.  You managed to get the perspective I was looking for.</td>', 'Nice shot... the black and white works well for the subject matter.  I shot several ''cemetary'' fences that didn''t make the cut.  You managed to get the perspective I was looking for.', '2007-01-03 16:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176682, 444594, 70661, '<td valign="top">Nice photo...wish I was there right now!</td>', 'Nice photo...wish I was there right now!', '2007-01-03 16:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176691, 445768, 70661, '<td valign="top">I like this!</td>', 'I like this!', '2007-01-03 16:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176692, 446700, 66693, '<td valign="top">I like this... nice color even on what appears to be a dreary day.  Good job.</td>', 'I like this... nice color even on what appears to be a dreary day.  Good job.', '2007-01-03 16:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176698, 445994, 66693, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.  I love the colors.</td>', 'Very nicely done.  I love the colors.', '2007-01-03 16:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176701, 446654, 70661, '<td valign="top">Very nice..I swear the clouds are moving!</td>', 'Very nice..I swear the clouds are moving!', '2007-01-03 16:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176704, 445746, 70661, '<td valign="top">nice photo!</td>', 'nice photo!', '2007-01-03 16:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176705, 444691, 61222, '<td valign="top">Great colors and clarity and just sooo cute :-)</td>', 'Great colors and clarity and just sooo cute :-)', '2007-01-03 16:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176715, 444566, 26001, '<td valign="top">very cool angle and perfect choice of color-shade to convey "cold"</td>', 'very cool angle and perfect choice of color-shade to convey "cold"', '2007-01-03 16:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176716, 446609, 30049, '<td valign="top">Looks like horse country.  :D  This if fun to look at, and there are certainly plenty of fences!  The POV for this is very nice.  What would it look like from the bottom by the gate looking toward where you were standing for this?  Maybe get some nice sky in the background?  Just a thought.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Looks like horse country.  :D  This if fun to look at, and there are certainly plenty of fences!  The POV for this is very nice.  What would it look like from the bottom by the gate looking toward where you were standing for this?  Maybe get some nice sky in the background?  Just a thought.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-01-03 16:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176724, 446743, 66693, '<td valign="top">The color and the lighting are nice.  I would like to have seen the rest of fence focused a little more but then you''d probably have lost some of the bokeh effect in the background.</td>', 'The color and the lighting are nice.  I would like to have seen the rest of fence focused a little more but then you''d probably have lost some of the bokeh effect in the background.', '2007-01-03 16:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176725, 445572, 70661, '<td valign="top">Awesome...love the photo.</td>', 'Awesome...love the photo.', '2007-01-03 16:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176727, 445763, 70661, '<td valign="top">nice photo.</td>', 'nice photo.', '2007-01-03 16:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176731, 445994, 70661, '<td valign="top">beautiful!</td>', 'beautiful!', '2007-01-03 16:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176738, 446521, 70661, '<td valign="top">I like this shot.</td>', 'I like this shot.', '2007-01-03 16:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176741, 443922, 66693, '<td valign="top">Nice angle.  Good color.  The sunset adds to the ''finality''(is that a word?? LOL) of the image.</td>', 'Nice angle.  Good color.  The sunset adds to the ''finality''(is that a word?? LOL) of the image.', '2007-01-03 16:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176749, 444997, 66693, '<td valign="top">LOVE the facial expression!  You managed to keep the fence one of the main focal points of the photograph but it is still not the primary subject.  Good job.</td>', 'LOVE the facial expression!  You managed to keep the fence one of the main focal points of the photograph but it is still not the primary subject.  Good job.', '2007-01-03 16:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176751, 444698, 26001, '<td valign="top">what a dramatic looking tree! i probably would have liked the shot simply in bw. the yellow cast seems out of place, somehow. (to me anyways) nice shot though.</td>', 'what a dramatic looking tree! i probably would have liked the shot simply in bw. the yellow cast seems out of place, somehow. (to me anyways) nice shot though.', '2007-01-03 16:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176756, 444263, 66693, '<td valign="top">Good use of shadows to ''light up'' what appears to have been a rather dreary winter day.</td>', 'Good use of shadows to ''light up'' what appears to have been a rather dreary winter day.', '2007-01-03 16:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176757, 446521, 26001, '<td valign="top">is this Twin owls at Estes park, Colorado? its always fun climbing around the area.</td>', 'is this Twin owls at Estes park, Colorado? its always fun climbing around the area.', '2007-01-03 16:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176761, 446654, 26001, '<td valign="top">burning of the sky looks a bit too artificial. i like the details on the wall though.</td>', 'burning of the sky looks a bit too artificial. i like the details on the wall though.', '2007-01-03 16:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176762, 446214, 66693, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Good color and light.  I would like to have had the fence a little more prominently displayed.  I wonder if you could have gotten the same glint of sunlight if you had shifted slightly left or right so that one of the fence posts was more centered??</td>', 'Great shot. Good color and light.  I would like to have had the fence a little more prominently displayed.  I wonder if you could have gotten the same glint of sunlight if you had shifted slightly left or right so that one of the fence posts was more centered??', '2007-01-03 16:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176765, 444263, 70928, '<td valign="top">very nice shot; I like that you got the black fences; recent fences in Kentucky and surroundings are no longer white; nice soft edges and lighting at dawn or dusk with nice shadows</td>', 'very nice shot; I like that you got the black fences; recent fences in Kentucky and surroundings are no longer white; nice soft edges and lighting at dawn or dusk with nice shadows', '2007-01-03 16:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176773, 446455, 66693, '<td valign="top">I like it.  The fence is an integral part of the photograph and yet with the focus on the hair, you don''t really notice it.  It just blends into the background.</td>', 'I like it.  The fence is an integral part of the photograph and yet with the focus on the hair, you don''t really notice it.  It just blends into the background.', '2007-01-03 16:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176774, 444616, 70928, '<td valign="top">great sky color; fences almost buried by drifts makes this an interesting picture</td>', 'great sky color; fences almost buried by drifts makes this an interesting picture', '2007-01-03 16:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176783, 446707, 26001, '<td valign="top">very very emotive!!! i like the mood and the tone you have used to convey the feeling.</td>', 'very very emotive!!! i like the mood and the tone you have used to convey the feeling.', '2007-01-03 16:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176784, 445401, 70928, '<td valign="top">interesting perspective; very sharp image</td>', 'interesting perspective; very sharp image', '2007-01-03 16:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176785, 446503, 70749, '<td valign="top">Not really a fence fence, but alriht. Love the cat.</td>', 'Not really a fence fence, but alriht. Love the cat.', '2007-01-03 16:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176795, 446620, 70749, '<td valign="top">Isn''t this challenge a fence!?</td>', 'Isn''t this challenge a fence!?', '2007-01-03 16:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176797, 445402, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like this.  Nice.  Concept is clean and simple - tells a story.  I wonder some if the dog isn''t stealing the show a little?  Tricky choice on selecting the correct aperture for this I imagine.  Deep enough to keep some detail in the dog, shallow enough to eliminate motion blur (if the dog moves).  Some of the fence fell out of the focal plane, but it''s sharp where it counts mostly.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'I like this.  Nice.  Concept is clean and simple - tells a story.  I wonder some if the dog isn''t stealing the show a little?  Tricky choice on selecting the correct aperture for this I imagine.  Deep enough to keep some detail in the dog, shallow enough to eliminate motion blur (if the dog moves).  Some of the fence fell out of the focal plane, but it''s sharp where it counts mostly.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2007-01-03 16:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176800, 446139, 70928, '<td valign="top">I like the wind blowing; not sure what''s going on in the sky--it doesn''t look real which to me distracts from the gate, fence and windblown plants</td>', 'I like the wind blowing; not sure what''s going on in the sky--it doesn''t look real which to me distracts from the gate, fence and windblown plants', '2007-01-03 16:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176801, 444704, 66693, '<td valign="top">I like the lines of the fence.  I wonder if you had zoomed out or shifted just a little left if the curve of the fence wouldn''t have been highlighted just a bit more??</td>', 'I like the lines of the fence.  I wonder if you had zoomed out or shifted just a little left if the curve of the fence wouldn''t have been highlighted just a bit more??', '2007-01-03 16:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176804, 446553, 70749, '<td valign="top">Nice. I love it. (10)</td>', 'Nice. I love it. (10)', '2007-01-03 16:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176805, 446065, 70928, '<td valign="top">very nice rays of sun and mist; nice lighting</td>', 'very nice rays of sun and mist; nice lighting', '2007-01-03 16:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176811, 445345, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the tones here.  Think I might even recognize the photographer based on the style of selective blurring.  :)  Good eye to see this.  Well done.</td>', 'I like the tones here.  Think I might even recognize the photographer based on the style of selective blurring.  :)  Good eye to see this.  Well done.', '2007-01-03 16:33:03.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3176813, 446214, 70928, '<td valign="top">nice scene; I wonder if it would have been better if the sun was a bit lower in the sky; it is a bit bright to me</td>', 'nice scene; I wonder if it would have been better if the sun was a bit lower in the sky; it is a bit bright to me', '2007-01-03 16:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176814, 444557, 70749, '<td valign="top">Thats a nice fence.</td>', 'Thats a nice fence.', '2007-01-03 16:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176815, 446099, 66693, '<td valign="top">I like the texture and the angle. I wonder if you positioned yourself just a little to the left if you could have gotten more of the space between the pillars and still had a similar effect&gt;</td>', 'I like the texture and the angle. I wonder if you positioned yourself just a little to the left if you could have gotten more of the space between the pillars and still had a similar effect>', '2007-01-03 16:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176819, 443976, 66693, '<td valign="top">Too pink/purple for my personal taste.</td>', 'Too pink/purple for my personal taste.', '2007-01-03 16:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176823, 445228, 70749, '<td valign="top">Wow! That is really nice! (9)</td>', 'Wow! That is really nice! (9)', '2007-01-03 16:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176826, 446065, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wonderful!  Nicely seen and captured.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Wonderful!  Nicely seen and captured.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-01-03 16:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176827, 444826, 62164, '<td valign="top">dont care for the sun flare</td>', 'dont care for the sun flare', '2007-01-03 16:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176832, 446290, 66693, '<td valign="top">I like the color and the light.  Good texture with the fence and the sand</td>', 'I like the color and the light.  Good texture with the fence and the sand', '2007-01-03 16:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176836, 444141, 70928, '<td valign="top">nice picture--it almost doesn''t look real to me; was there a lot of editing done?  maybe too much. great framing with the other horses and the ominous sky above</td>', 'nice picture--it almost doesn''t look real to me; was there a lot of editing done?  maybe too much. great framing with the other horses and the ominous sky above', '2007-01-03 16:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176847, 444997, 70928, '<td valign="top">you caught the cow with an interesting look on his/her face like "What are you doing with that camera!!"</td>', 'you caught the cow with an interesting look on his/her face like "What are you doing with that camera!!"', '2007-01-03 16:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176851, 446417, 70928, '<td valign="top">too much editing is distracting; but an interesting shot</td>', 'too much editing is distracting; but an interesting shot', '2007-01-03 16:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176859, 446743, 62164, '<td valign="top">wish things was green like that here in michigan!</td>', 'wish things was green like that here in michigan!', '2007-01-03 16:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176866, 445714, 66693, '<td valign="top">Interesting interpretation.  A little too dark for me.</td>', 'Interesting interpretation.  A little too dark for me.', '2007-01-03 16:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176881, 443697, 70928, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture; I like the title even more.  It says exactly what the photographer is imagining.  The detailed ice crystals on the posts is very nice.  Great use of B/W.</td>', 'I really like this picture; I like the title even more.  It says exactly what the photographer is imagining.  The detailed ice crystals on the posts is very nice.  Great use of B/W.', '2007-01-03 16:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176887, 446311, 66693, '<td valign="top">I like it.  You managed to focus in on the single fence post without completely blurring out the background.  Almost like two photos in one.</td>', 'I like it.  You managed to focus in on the single fence post without completely blurring out the background.  Almost like two photos in one.', '2007-01-03 16:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176902, 444937, 66693, '<td valign="top">Good shot.  I would have liked to see a little more light on her face.  Maybe if you had her turn her right just a tad but keep her eyes pointed toward the camera??</td>', 'Good shot.  I would have liked to see a little more light on her face.  Maybe if you had her turn her right just a tad but keep her eyes pointed toward the camera??', '2007-01-03 16:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176911, 446260, 66693, '<td valign="top">I love this shot.  Shadows, light and the colors of a sunrise (or set) will get me every time.</td>', 'I love this shot.  Shadows, light and the colors of a sunrise (or set) will get me every time.', '2007-01-03 16:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176919, 446553, 70928, '<td valign="top">I like this picture very much.  Great clouds and light.</td>', 'I like this picture very much.  Great clouds and light.', '2007-01-03 16:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176922, 443975, 33736, '<td valign="top">The "Fence" is lost in this otherwise terrific image.</td>', 'The "Fence" is lost in this otherwise terrific image.', '2007-01-03 16:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176931, 446388, 66693, '<td valign="top">My mom fenced her garden with those red gates.  I almost took a shot of them.  Yours is much more dramatic with the snow.  The touch of color really adds to scene.</td>', 'My mom fenced her garden with those red gates.  I almost took a shot of them.  Yours is much more dramatic with the snow.  The touch of color really adds to scene.', '2007-01-03 16:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176938, 446100, 33736, '<td valign="top">The fence is almost incidental (including in the title.)</td>', 'The fence is almost incidental (including in the title.)', '2007-01-03 16:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176940, 444976, 66693, '<td valign="top">The dappled sunlight is a nice effect but the overall picture is a little too dark for my taste.</td>', 'The dappled sunlight is a nice effect but the overall picture is a little too dark for my taste.', '2007-01-03 16:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176943, 444929, 70928, '<td valign="top">One of the more original interpretations of a "fence".  I like the flowing water.  Even more so, the multiple spots of water coming through.</td>', 'One of the more original interpretations of a "fence".  I like the flowing water.  Even more so, the multiple spots of water coming through.', '2007-01-03 16:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176953, 444263, 33736, '<td valign="top">Beautiful tones and lines - but, I would have preferred it not to lead to the near dead-center.</td>', 'Beautiful tones and lines - but, I would have preferred it not to lead to the near dead-center.', '2007-01-03 16:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176954, 445003, 58567, '<td valign="top">Excellent perspective...nice use of the rule of thirds</td>', 'Excellent perspective...nice use of the rule of thirds', '2007-01-03 16:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176958, 444688, 70928, '<td valign="top">I like the expression of the horse the best!</td>', 'I like the expression of the horse the best!', '2007-01-03 16:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3176961, 445308, 58567, '<td valign="top">Good ''wow'' factor...good balance and structure</td>', 'Good ''wow'' factor...good balance and structure', '2007-01-03 16:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
