(3177635, 444826, 67258, '<td valign="top">I am not keen on the external part of the border.  This may not have been the best time of the day to photograph this particular scene - the haziness may be caused by shooting in to the light (as indicated by the shadows).  That said, you have a well composed shot with a nice sweep of the fence leading the eye.</td>', 'I am not keen on the external part of the border.  This may not have been the best time of the day to photograph this particular scene - the haziness may be caused by shooting in to the light (as indicated by the shadows).  That said, you have a well composed shot with a nice sweep of the fence leading the eye.', '2007-01-03 18:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3177637, 446270, 63588, '<td valign="top">Feels a little washed out. I like the tall grass on one side of the fence and the shorter field on the other.</td>', 'Feels a little washed out. I like the tall grass on one side of the fence and the shorter field on the other.', '2007-01-03 18:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
