(3179538, 446234, 18073, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and great colour.  The problem for me is the composition, with the spikes in the background interupting the shape of the silhouette (and focal point)in the foreground.  Perhaps moving around a little to the right would have separated the nearest spike from the background.  Good effort</td>', 'Nice idea and great colour.  The problem for me is the composition, with the spikes in the background interupting the shape of the silhouette (and focal point)in the foreground.  Perhaps moving around a little to the right would have separated the nearest spike from the background.  Good effort', '2007-01-04 06:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3179594, 445202, 18073, '<td valign="top">I love this image.  The colours are fantastic but for me its the composition that I like most, it breaks all the rules and shouldn''t work, but it does.  Great work, and I hope it gets the credit it deserves, its a fine image!</td>', 'I love this image.  The colours are fantastic but for me its the composition that I like most, it breaks all the rules and shouldn''t work, but it does.  Great work, and I hope it gets the credit it deserves, its a fine image!', '2007-01-04 07:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
