(3182253, 445743, 67723, '<td valign="top">The ground and main subject the fence are underexposed. Hard to capture in one image though.  One very cool aspect of this photograph though is the reflection of the fence and sunset in the water. <b>Coolness</b></td>', 'The ground and main subject the fence are underexposed. Hard to capture in one image though.  One very cool aspect of this photograph though is the reflection of the fence and sunset in the water. Coolness', '2007-01-04 18:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
