(3182269, 443468, 67723, '<td valign="top">Way too cluttered. You would have gotten better results in early morning or evening when the sun wasn''t so harsh.</td>', 'Way too cluttered. You would have gotten better results in early morning or evening when the sun wasn''t so harsh.', '2007-01-04 18:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182287, 446591, 67723, '<td valign="top">Very good.  Although I would have cropped it into a square photo to get rid of the distracting silver post.  The red berries defineitely add something but the right 3rd of the photo isn''t very attractive, and the fence leads your eye right into it.   (hope this helps)</td>', 'Very good.  Although I would have cropped it into a square photo to get rid of the distracting silver post.  The red berries defineitely add something but the right 3rd of the photo isn''t very attractive, and the fence leads your eye right into it.   (hope this helps)', '2007-01-04 18:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182295, 446750, 67723, '<td valign="top">Awesome this is the first really good shot I''ve seen since voting.  I love the Haze the relfections off the first fence and the composition. I hope you do well.  9</td>', 'Awesome this is the first really good shot I''ve seen since voting.  I love the Haze the relfections off the first fence and the composition. I hope you do well.  9', '2007-01-04 18:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182307, 446620, 71064, '<td valign="top">I don''t undestand where is the fence</td>', 'I don''t undestand where is the fence', '2007-01-04 18:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182308, 446638, 67723, '<td valign="top">The challenge is fences.  This photo <b>does</b>meet the challenge, however, the focus is more on the dog than the fence.  If I would want a picture of my pet to hang on my wall I would not want the fence in front of it, as it takes away from the impact the dog makes.  <br/> <br/>As a picture of a fence it is very uninteresting, and as a picture of a do the fence in front of it wrecks it.</td>', 'The challenge is fences.  This photo doesmeet the challenge, however, the focus is more on the dog than the fence.  If I would want a picture of my pet to hang on my wall I would not want the fence in front of it, as it takes away from the impact the dog makes.   As a picture of a fence it is very uninteresting, and as a picture of a do the fence in front of it wrecks it.', '2007-01-04 18:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182327, 444897, 71064, '<td valign="top">I think the fence isn''t important.</td>', 'I think the fence isn''t important.', '2007-01-04 18:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182336, 444805, 67723, '<td valign="top">This photo <b>does</b> <b>meet</b> the challenge, however, as a picture of a fence it is very boring, and as a picture of the building the fence in front of it wrecks it.  It would be better to creatively photograph the fence instead of just sticking a fence into a photo just to meet the challenge.  The emphasis in this photo is not at all the fence, instread it is the building.  This is all just my opinion but I hope you understand what I am trying to say.</td>', 'This photo does meet the challenge, however, as a picture of a fence it is very boring, and as a picture of the building the fence in front of it wrecks it.  It would be better to creatively photograph the fence instead of just sticking a fence into a photo just to meet the challenge.  The emphasis in this photo is not at all the fence, instread it is the building.  This is all just my opinion but I hope you understand what I am trying to say.', '2007-01-04 18:54:34.000000', NULL, 1);
