(3182619, 445402, 55837, '<td valign="top">I was thinking of doing something like this but I have a Teacup Yorkshire Terrier.  It wouldn''t have the same effect.</td>', 'I was thinking of doing something like this but I have a Teacup Yorkshire Terrier.  It wouldn''t have the same effect.', '2007-01-04 20:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
