(3182645, 445504, 71274, '<td valign="top">There''s something forlorn about a neglected fence; this image captures that emotion well.</td>', 'There''s something forlorn about a neglected fence; this image captures that emotion well.', '2007-01-04 20:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182671, 443744, 71274, '<td valign="top">What a spirited leap!</td>', 'What a spirited leap!', '2007-01-04 20:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182677, 443779, 71274, '<td valign="top">I wonder how many thousands of miles of barbed wire are lurking unseen behind denser foilage than this. Lovely colors and tone in this shot.</td>', 'I wonder how many thousands of miles of barbed wire are lurking unseen behind denser foilage than this. Lovely colors and tone in this shot.', '2007-01-04 20:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182694, 446417, 55837, '<td valign="top">It looks like difuse glow, I would like to know your editing steps to try this myself. 8</td>', 'It looks like difuse glow, I would like to know your editing steps to try this myself. 8', '2007-01-04 20:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182734, 444493, 71274, '<td valign="top">Great color, nice DOF, and interesting point of view.</td>', 'Great color, nice DOF, and interesting point of view.', '2007-01-04 20:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182754, 446383, 26001, '<td valign="top">one of the, if not the, sharpest image(s) of the challenge. i wonder having smooth bokeh by sharpening forground and background differently would help the shot. nonetheless my favourite with a 9.</td>', 'one of the, if not the, sharpest image(s) of the challenge. i wonder having smooth bokeh by sharpening forground and background differently would help the shot. nonetheless my favourite with a 9.', '2007-01-04 20:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182779, 446590, 71274, '<td valign="top">Creative way to build a stockade type fence. Textures perfectly suited to the sepia tones.</td>', 'Creative way to build a stockade type fence. Textures perfectly suited to the sepia tones.', '2007-01-04 20:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182836, 446705, 71274, '<td valign="top">I hate white board fences but it''s kind of neat how the fencing in this pic snakes all over the place.</td>', 'I hate white board fences but it''s kind of neat how the fencing in this pic snakes all over the place.', '2007-01-04 20:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182857, 444423, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the use of black &amp; white for your shot and how the fence leads to the off-centered convergence point.</td>', 'I like the use of black & white for your shot and how the fence leads to the off-centered convergence point.', '2007-01-04 21:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182862, 444507, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the reflections. Coloring looks a bit...odd somehow. A little too green or overly saturated, but overall I like your image. Good luck in the challenge. 8</td>', 'I like the reflections. Coloring looks a bit...odd somehow. A little too green or overly saturated, but overall I like your image. Good luck in the challenge. 8', '2007-01-04 21:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182864, 445418, 41675, '<td valign="top">I think you had a good idea, yet I find the foreground foliage distracting.</td>', 'I think you had a good idea, yet I find the foreground foliage distracting.', '2007-01-04 21:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182868, 444698, 41675, '<td valign="top">Overall, a very nice and serene photo. This is the type of image I could hang on my walls. I like the tonal values too. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Overall, a very nice and serene photo. This is the type of image I could hang on my walls. I like the tonal values too. Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-01-04 21:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182877, 444601, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast in your image. Nice compositionas well. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the contrast in your image. Nice compositionas well. Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-01-04 21:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182893, 446299, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, I think a different angle or viewpoint would make your image more interesting. Perhaps also cropping it tighter on the right hand side to eliminate the building in the background.</td>', 'For me, I think a different angle or viewpoint would make your image more interesting. Perhaps also cropping it tighter on the right hand side to eliminate the building in the background.', '2007-01-04 21:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182897, 445743, 41675, '<td valign="top">Cool photo - the coloring look a bit on the surreal side...I almost expect to see some hobbits somewhere. :-) I like thecomposition and lighting. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Cool photo - the coloring look a bit on the surreal side...I almost expect to see some hobbits somewhere. :-) I like thecomposition and lighting. Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-01-04 21:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182902, 443976, 41675, '<td valign="top">I looked at your image for a few second before AI even saw the fence - the topic of the challenge. Had it been more prominent I would have scored it higher. Its the background dome element that my eyes are drawn too. Nice colors though.</td>', 'I looked at your image for a few second before AI even saw the fence - the topic of the challenge. Had it been more prominent I would have scored it higher. Its the background dome element that my eyes are drawn too. Nice colors though.', '2007-01-04 21:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182904, 444500, 41675, '<td valign="top">Cool fence. I wonder if lookiing at if from below, or closer or above - a different angle would make it even more interesting.</td>', 'Cool fence. I wonder if lookiing at if from below, or closer or above - a different angle would make it even more interesting.', '2007-01-04 21:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182908, 446351, 41675, '<td valign="top">A good, gritty kind of journalistic image. The fence isn''t very exciting for me, but I like the black &amp; white treatment you chose.</td>', 'A good, gritty kind of journalistic image. The fence isn''t very exciting for me, but I like the black & white treatment you chose.', '2007-01-04 21:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182916, 446607, 41675, '<td valign="top">Very clever image. :-) I like the fence angle. Unique and different. Good luck in the challenge. 9</td>', 'Very clever image. :-) I like the fence angle. Unique and different. Good luck in the challenge. 9', '2007-01-04 21:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182922, 445216, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, the gray values are a bit flat. I think a bit more contrast would make your image "pop" a bit more. Good closeup composition.</td>', 'For me, the gray values are a bit flat. I think a bit more contrast would make your image "pop" a bit more. Good closeup composition.', '2007-01-04 21:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182942, 444236, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the angle you chose. Good sky too.</td>', 'I like the angle you chose. Good sky too.', '2007-01-04 21:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3182983, 445760, 41675, '<td valign="top">Just my opinion: if your gray tones had more contrast, and the subject not "dead center" and taken from a higher or lower angle, your image would be more interesting for me.</td>', 'Just my opinion: if your gray tones had more contrast, and the subject not "dead center" and taken from a higher or lower angle, your image would be more interesting for me.', '2007-01-04 21:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183023, 445872, 60865, '<td valign="top">art school, don''t care for it</td>', 'art school, don''t care for it', '2007-01-04 22:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183050, 446431, 26001, '<td valign="top">addition of the web and water drops make this shot better than an ordinary close-up. i like the sepia tone, reflections in the drops a lot. 9</td>', 'addition of the web and water drops make this shot better than an ordinary close-up. i like the sepia tone, reflections in the drops a lot. 9', '2007-01-04 22:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183054, 446478, 26001, '<td valign="top">you have done an excellent job capturing character of this fence. i like the dark/black background too. i wish the background water drop was also in the focus though. 9</td>', 'you have done an excellent job capturing character of this fence. i like the dark/black background too. i wish the background water drop was also in the focus though. 9', '2007-01-04 22:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183079, 446685, 164, '<td valign="top">the greenery is gorgeous.</td>', 'the greenery is gorgeous.', '2007-01-04 22:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183098, 443408, 164, '<td valign="top">bland</td>', 'bland', '2007-01-04 22:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183105, 446677, 70883, '<td valign="top">Interesting lighting. I just can''t see if the black ground is sand or what... too dark.</td>', 'Interesting lighting. I just can''t see if the black ground is sand or what... too dark.', '2007-01-04 22:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183112, 446289, 70883, '<td valign="top">Simple is good but here, the composition doesn''t work for you. The picture frame is directly behind the bar. When things are stacked directly on top of each other, visually, the eye is annoyed.</td>', 'Simple is good but here, the composition doesn''t work for you. The picture frame is directly behind the bar. When things are stacked directly on top of each other, visually, the eye is annoyed.', '2007-01-04 22:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183212, 445093, 7743, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea however I think the image would benefit from a little more DOF.</td>', 'Interesting idea however I think the image would benefit from a little more DOF.', '2007-01-04 22:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183248, 446372, 7743, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  An improvement may be to shoot from a position more to the right and have the camera view straight down the boy''s arm.</td>', 'Good idea.  An improvement may be to shoot from a position more to the right and have the camera view straight down the boy''s arm.', '2007-01-04 23:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183284, 446065, 23141, '<td valign="top">This is lovely, and I think will do very well.  I give it a nine.  In my personal opinion, the shadows on the trees seem a bit light.</td>', 'This is lovely, and I think will do very well.  I give it a nine.  In my personal opinion, the shadows on the trees seem a bit light.', '2007-01-04 23:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183285, 446389, 23141, '<td valign="top">Your foreground fence is blurry; your rearground fence lacks punch.  I understand your concept, but this seems poorly executed.</td>', 'Your foreground fence is blurry; your rearground fence lacks punch.  I understand your concept, but this seems poorly executed.', '2007-01-04 23:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183289, 446566, 23141, '<td valign="top">I really like this, but feel the tilt is too extreme for me personally.</td>', 'I really like this, but feel the tilt is too extreme for me personally.', '2007-01-04 23:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183296, 446234, 23141, '<td valign="top">An interesting idea with nice colors.  The distracting silhouettes in the background and the fact that your main point of interest isn''t straight on with the camera detract from the image, though.</td>', 'An interesting idea with nice colors.  The distracting silhouettes in the background and the fact that your main point of interest isn''t straight on with the camera detract from the image, though.', '2007-01-04 23:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183302, 444432, 23141, '<td valign="top">Cute idea, and I think the black and white could add to the mood.  However, the dog isn''t large enough in this composition for me.  I had to read the title and then look for the subject.  Move in, remove the foreground and unneccesary side walls.</td>', 'Cute idea, and I think the black and white could add to the mood.  However, the dog isn''t large enough in this composition for me.  I had to read the title and then look for the subject.  Move in, remove the foreground and unneccesary side walls.', '2007-01-04 23:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183312, 446629, 23141, '<td valign="top">Interesting combination of colors.  I understand this to be part of a fence, but it doesn''t strike me as enough of the fence.  Does that make sense?  Still, a 7.  Good focus and nice texture.</td>', 'Interesting combination of colors.  I understand this to be part of a fence, but it doesn''t strike me as enough of the fence.  Does that make sense?  Still, a 7.  Good focus and nice texture.', '2007-01-04 23:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183322, 446708, 23141, '<td valign="top">This could be so pretty!  It''s a good idea, unfortunately the angle you chose to compose with is hurting you here.  I really like the far end of the fence in this image; it''s the front section that''s so distracting.  Perhaps a different crop would help; perhaps it needs to be re-taken from another angle.</td>', 'This could be so pretty!  It''s a good idea, unfortunately the angle you chose to compose with is hurting you here.  I really like the far end of the fence in this image; it''s the front section that''s so distracting.  Perhaps a different crop would help; perhaps it needs to be re-taken from another angle.', '2007-01-04 23:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183333, 446718, 23141, '<td valign="top">Argh!  I can barely see the sunset!  Had to go looking for it.  And the dunes seem really washed out, even if they were in shadow.  I''d like to see more sky; perhaps the red of the sunset gilding the fence posts.  This image certainly meets the challenge and has a lot of potential with a re-take.</td>', 'Argh!  I can barely see the sunset!  Had to go looking for it.  And the dunes seem really washed out, even if they were in shadow.  I''d like to see more sky; perhaps the red of the sunset gilding the fence posts.  This image certainly meets the challenge and has a lot of potential with a re-take.', '2007-01-04 23:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183345, 446665, 23141, '<td valign="top">This is neat, something unexpected in a fence challenge.  The angle seems to be a bit too low, though.  This would put the focus more on the tangle of sticks in the bird''s nest, but I can totally see this image when taken from an angle near the nest and done in black and white.  Probably wouldn''t meet the challenge then, but might make a really neat print!</td>', 'This is neat, something unexpected in a fence challenge.  The angle seems to be a bit too low, though.  This would put the focus more on the tangle of sticks in the bird''s nest, but I can totally see this image when taken from an angle near the nest and done in black and white.  Probably wouldn''t meet the challenge then, but might make a really neat print!', '2007-01-04 23:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183348, 446590, 61413, '<td valign="top">Just the right sepia tone for this shot.</td>', 'Just the right sepia tone for this shot.', '2007-01-04 23:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183352, 444475, 47316, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. It would be so amazing if the sky was as blue as the pond!<br/> <br/>Wish the back horizon was more straight or something. I know it''s hard with all the different angles but the line of the hill seems to me to be the one that should be straight to make the sky even.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. It would be so amazing if the sky was as blue as the pond! Wish the back horizon was more straight or something. I know it''s hard with all the different angles but the line of the hill seems to me to be the one that should be straight to make the sky even.', '2007-01-04 23:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183355, 445024, 61413, '<td valign="top">The sky gradient is pleasing to the eye. But nothing else really grabs me about this. Sorry.</td>', 'The sky gradient is pleasing to the eye. But nothing else really grabs me about this. Sorry.', '2007-01-04 23:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183356, 446195, 47316, '<td valign="top">Not sure if I like the darkened edges. Makes it seem unnatural and this is a very natural shot.</td>', 'Not sure if I like the darkened edges. Makes it seem unnatural and this is a very natural shot.', '2007-01-04 23:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183358, 446531, 23141, '<td valign="top">Okay, the processing looks pretty cool, but I think you''ve taken the reds a bit too far to make a top placement in this challenge.</td>', 'Okay, the processing looks pretty cool, but I think you''ve taken the reds a bit too far to make a top placement in this challenge.', '2007-01-04 23:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183364, 446609, 47316, '<td valign="top">Nice shapes and lines but I feel as though it''s lacking somehow. I think this photo is missing a real subject.</td>', 'Nice shapes and lines but I feel as though it''s lacking somehow. I think this photo is missing a real subject.', '2007-01-04 23:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
