(3183371, 446372, 47316, '<td valign="top">Not a fan of the red tint. I think your really short changed yourself by not showing the colors of the water and sky. Not liking how much you focus the little girl''s bottom takes either.</td>', 'Not a fan of the red tint. I think your really short changed yourself by not showing the colors of the water and sky. Not liking how much you focus the little girl''s bottom takes either.', '2007-01-04 23:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
