(3183393, 446656, 13207, '<td valign="top">I love the colors in this shot.</td>', 'I love the colors in this shot.', '2007-01-04 23:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183394, 443475, 47316, '<td valign="top">I really am not a fan of the editing on this photo. I would like to see the original because it seems like it could be a really great image.</td>', 'I really am not a fan of the editing on this photo. I would like to see the original because it seems like it could be a really great image.', '2007-01-04 23:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183396, 446328, 13207, '<td valign="top">I don''t usually like borders, but for this shot it seems to work really well for bringing out the red in the fence.  Good job.</td>', 'I don''t usually like borders, but for this shot it seems to work really well for bringing out the red in the fence.  Good job.', '2007-01-04 23:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183398, 443537, 47316, '<td valign="top">Cut out the cars and you would have gone up at least a point. Even so the photo is not very interesting.</td>', 'Cut out the cars and you would have gone up at least a point. Even so the photo is not very interesting.', '2007-01-04 23:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183405, 446461, 47316, '<td valign="top">Nice. I was debating entering a shot similar to this actually and went with something completely different. Hate to be typical but this might have really benefited from using 3rds, I feel the barb is too close to the edge. Could also use a little more contrast to pop the wire out a bit.</td>', 'Nice. I was debating entering a shot similar to this actually and went with something completely different. Hate to be typical but this might have really benefited from using 3rds, I feel the barb is too close to the edge. Could also use a little more contrast to pop the wire out a bit.', '2007-01-04 23:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183410, 446685, 47316, '<td valign="top">What is going on around the tips of the fence I can''t tell if it''s pixilated there or what? It''s really distracting. Also I think this perspective could have benefited from having the path more in view instead of the tree.</td>', 'What is going on around the tips of the fence I can''t tell if it''s pixilated there or what? It''s really distracting. Also I think this perspective could have benefited from having the path more in view instead of the tree.', '2007-01-04 23:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183419, 445829, 47316, '<td valign="top">Pretty subject with potential but the photo doesn''t really do it for me.</td>', 'Pretty subject with potential but the photo doesn''t really do it for me.', '2007-01-04 23:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183425, 445308, 47316, '<td valign="top">Solid epic shot. Nicely done.</td>', 'Solid epic shot. Nicely done.', '2007-01-04 23:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183427, 446365, 61413, '<td valign="top">I love the way the fenceline leads the eye into the shot. The whole thing is very well composed, creating something very evocative of a rural english winter. The dark grey overcast sky helps with that! :-)</td>', 'I love the way the fenceline leads the eye into the shot. The whole thing is very well composed, creating something very evocative of a rural english winter. The dark grey overcast sky helps with that! :-)', '2007-01-04 23:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183441, 444880, 61413, '<td valign="top">Maybe it''s my screen, but I can''t see a thing here...</td>', 'Maybe it''s my screen, but I can''t see a thing here...', '2007-01-04 23:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183442, 446685, 48928, '<td valign="top">Around the edges of the fence you can see where you blurred the photo, there is a halo of sharpness around the fence posts.  Try zooming in more within your editing and check a little but closer...  goodluck</td>', 'Around the edges of the fence you can see where you blurred the photo, there is a halo of sharpness around the fence posts.  Try zooming in more within your editing and check a little but closer...  goodluck', '2007-01-04 23:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
