(3183455, 446660, 47316, '<td valign="top">Looks splotchy like there was too much noise reduction.</td>', 'Looks splotchy like there was too much noise reduction.', '2007-01-04 23:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183464, 445202, 47316, '<td valign="top">There is something interesting about this shot. Certainly stands out! The white shoe is blow out. Think you could have gone further with this shot.</td>', 'There is something interesting about this shot. Certainly stands out! The white shoe is blow out. Think you could have gone further with this shot.', '2007-01-04 23:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183472, 444704, 47316, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. I would almost like to see this vertical or square crop with the animals in the corner to make the animals more prominent, the trees don''t really add anything to the photo for me.</td>', 'Beautiful. I would almost like to see this vertical or square crop with the animals in the corner to make the animals more prominent, the trees don''t really add anything to the photo for me.', '2007-01-04 23:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183476, 446656, 47316, '<td valign="top">Nice editing. I like this slightly muted look.</td>', 'Nice editing. I like this slightly muted look.', '2007-01-04 23:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183479, 443557, 47316, '<td valign="top">This is a neat location but I''m not a fan of the editing. Perhaps if you had gone a little more subtle? Like not saturate the fence so much and not desaturate everything else completely, only a bit.</td>', 'This is a neat location but I''m not a fan of the editing. Perhaps if you had gone a little more subtle? Like not saturate the fence so much and not desaturate everything else completely, only a bit.', '2007-01-04 23:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183480, 444039, 61413, '<td valign="top">There''s a lot to this, that all comes together to make it "work".<br/> <br/>Monochrome is always good for creating a sombre tone. The subject is mostly in the dark, except for her hand, which is creating a strong sense of "the light" being on the viewers side of the fence - she is imprisoned, not us.<br/> <br/>The building in the background has a vaguely institutional look, too. wherever she''s imprisoned, it''s not a holiday camp.<br/> <br/>Then there''s the lip-ring, the lanky hair, and the expression of the subject. Wherever she is, it''s ground her down. She''s defeated, just biding her time.<br/> <br/>The lighting on the hand is overdone, obviously. And the gadget that she''s holding is distracting, as (to a less extent) is whatever it is intruding into the shot at top right. But overall it works well.</td>', 'There''s a lot to this, that all comes together to make it "work". Monochrome is always good for creating a sombre tone. The subject is mostly in the dark, except for her hand, which is creating a strong sense of "the light" being on the viewers side of the fence - she is imprisoned, not us. The building in the background has a vaguely institutional look, too. wherever she''s imprisoned, it''s not a holiday camp. Then there''s the lip-ring, the lanky hair, and the expression of the subject. Wherever she is, it''s ground her down. She''s defeated, just biding her time. The lighting on the hand is overdone, obviously. And the gadget that she''s holding is distracting, as (to a less extent) is whatever it is intruding into the shot at top right. But overall it works well.', '2007-01-04 23:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183482, 444937, 47316, '<td valign="top">Way to red for me. Cute little girl. I would have gone with a more earthy outfit.</td>', 'Way to red for me. Cute little girl. I would have gone with a more earthy outfit.', '2007-01-04 23:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183486, 443697, 47316, '<td valign="top">Love the perspective on this.</td>', 'Love the perspective on this.', '2007-01-04 23:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
