(3183505, 444698, 48928, '<td valign="top">This seems a little bit stretched??  I like the picture I think it is beautiful, but either through editing or perspective it looks unnaturally stretched horizontally. 6</td>', 'This seems a little bit stretched??  I like the picture I think it is beautiful, but either through editing or perspective it looks unnaturally stretched horizontally. 6', '2007-01-04 23:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183517, 444929, 61413, '<td valign="top">Kinda stretching the definiton of a fence, methinks...<br/> <br/>Putting that to one side, canal locks have huge photographic potential. This one might have benefited from any or all of:<br/>- being taken at a lower angle;<br/>- using a much slower shutter speed (if you could find some way of stabilising your camera), to create a "mystic" effect from the water;<br/>- tweaking up the saturation and contrast to bring a darker, older, more gloomy feel (locks are usually old, dark and gloomy places...)</td>', 'Kinda stretching the definiton of a fence, methinks... Putting that to one side, canal locks have huge photographic potential. This one might have benefited from any or all of:- being taken at a lower angle;- using a much slower shutter speed (if you could find some way of stabilising your camera), to create a "mystic" effect from the water;- tweaking up the saturation and contrast to bring a darker, older, more gloomy feel (locks are usually old, dark and gloomy places...)', '2007-01-04 23:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183521, 443697, 48928, '<td valign="top">Beautiful... I love the BW treatment, the snow/frost and the lines of the photo....9</td>', 'Beautiful... I love the BW treatment, the snow/frost and the lines of the photo....9', '2007-01-04 23:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183522, 446065, 61413, '<td valign="top">Very effective. I would have tried playing with the black-point to make the tree-line a little darker and maybe more distinct from the sky (particularly over on the right).</td>', 'Very effective. I would have tried playing with the black-point to make the tree-line a little darker and maybe more distinct from the sky (particularly over on the right).', '2007-01-04 23:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183527, 446290, 48928, '<td valign="top">This is so pretty, nice to think about in January too  :)  8</td>', 'This is so pretty, nice to think about in January too  :)  8', '2007-01-04 23:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183528, 446638, 61413, '<td valign="top">Lovely expression on the dogs face - a definite sense of being fenced in.<br/> <br/>I would have taken the shot from lower, down at the dogs''s level. Then in post-processing maybe played with the saturation levels of the reds and yellows, to bring out the colour of the dog more.</td>', 'Lovely expression on the dogs face - a definite sense of being fenced in. I would have taken the shot from lower, down at the dogs''s level. Then in post-processing maybe played with the saturation levels of the reds and yellows, to bring out the colour of the dog more.', '2007-01-04 23:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183544, 446469, 61413, '<td valign="top">A nice idea, but I think the perspective on the fence is just a bit too steep. If you''d taken one large step to the right, it would''ve worked a lot better, I think.</td>', 'A nice idea, but I think the perspective on the fence is just a bit too steep. If you''d taken one large step to the right, it would''ve worked a lot better, I think.', '2007-01-05 00:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183546, 445184, 61413, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, and well composed. But the bright high-key approach misses the mark a little, I think.</td>', 'Nice idea, and well composed. But the bright high-key approach misses the mark a little, I think.', '2007-01-05 00:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183560, 444622, 61413, '<td valign="top">What a strange "fence"!<br/> <br/>Nicely composed.</td>', 'What a strange "fence"! Nicely composed.', '2007-01-05 00:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183565, 444521, 61413, '<td valign="top">Nice use of space on the right. Something for the cheetah to move into...</td>', 'Nice use of space on the right. Something for the cheetah to move into...', '2007-01-05 00:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183578, 445797, 61413, '<td valign="top">I love the textures of the grass and the wood. Nicely framed shot, too. I think the "fog" aspect is just a bit of a distraction, though.</td>', 'I love the textures of the grass and the wood. Nicely framed shot, too. I think the "fog" aspect is just a bit of a distraction, though.', '2007-01-05 00:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183593, 446383, 61413, '<td valign="top">Lovely detail in the hoar frost. And good background colouring.</td>', 'Lovely detail in the hoar frost. And good background colouring.', '2007-01-05 00:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
