(3183921, 445174, 70948, '<td valign="top">It''s a great leading line and pattern. Nice composition. Not an extremely interesting photo, but technically it is fairly strong. Fences should lead to something.</td>', 'It''s a great leading line and pattern. Nice composition. Not an extremely interesting photo, but technically it is fairly strong. Fences should lead to something.', '2007-01-05 03:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
