(3183926, 443475, 6804, '<td valign="top">Unusual processing technique.  I like it.  I do clearly see the fence in this even though the fence is not the primary subject.  I am giving this one high marks.</td>', 'Unusual processing technique.  I like it.  I do clearly see the fence in this even though the fence is not the primary subject.  I am giving this one high marks.', '2007-01-05 03:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
