(3183930, 443255, 62187, '<td valign="top">The photo is so-so compared to some of the others. I like the observation and the title...for that - 8. Good luck to ya!</td>', 'The photo is so-so compared to some of the others. I like the observation and the title...for that - 8. Good luck to ya!', '2007-01-05 03:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183933, 446653, 62187, '<td valign="top">It looks like you''ve used a long lens and cropped the photo stretching the pixels beyond their limit. I don''t know, that''s just a guess. I think if your photo would have had a wider view, it would have been perfect. Like some of the other photos in this challenge, the subject seems to be something other then the actual fence. The photo is not bad at all and your lucky to live or have been somewhere to see this kind of thing.</td>', 'It looks like you''ve used a long lens and cropped the photo stretching the pixels beyond their limit. I don''t know, that''s just a guess. I think if your photo would have had a wider view, it would have been perfect. Like some of the other photos in this challenge, the subject seems to be something other then the actual fence. The photo is not bad at all and your lucky to live or have been somewhere to see this kind of thing.', '2007-01-05 03:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183937, 444774, 62187, '<td valign="top">I hope I''m not missing something. It looks like a small wire figurine of somekind that sort of resembles a fence that''s been stuck (?) to a stucco wall. Hmmm?</td>', 'I hope I''m not missing something. It looks like a small wire figurine of somekind that sort of resembles a fence that''s been stuck (?) to a stucco wall. Hmmm?', '2007-01-05 03:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183939, 446584, 62187, '<td valign="top">DOF...very cool...maybe just a little tilted to the right? I like it...8</td>', 'DOF...very cool...maybe just a little tilted to the right? I like it...8', '2007-01-05 03:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183953, 446718, 6804, '<td valign="top">This has potential to be a good shot, but to me, it is lacking in a couple of basic fundamental areas.  I know the rules of composition are nothing more than guidelines and can be broken.  Give this link a quick look.  It may be of help to you in positioning your horizon or at least give you some options to consider.  <br/> <br/>//www.colorpilot.com/comp_rules.html<br/> <br/>In this case, I think I would have cropped the sky completely out, or included it only if it would fill at least the top 1/3 of the photo.  Then maybe a couple tweaks of brightness and contrast.   I hope this has been helpful to you.</td>', 'This has potential to be a good shot, but to me, it is lacking in a couple of basic fundamental areas.  I know the rules of composition are nothing more than guidelines and can be broken.  Give this link a quick look.  It may be of help to you in positioning your horizon or at least give you some options to consider.   //www.colorpilot.com/comp_rules.html In this case, I think I would have cropped the sky completely out, or included it only if it would fill at least the top 1/3 of the photo.  Then maybe a couple tweaks of brightness and contrast.   I hope this has been helpful to you.', '2007-01-05 04:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183957, 446581, 62187, '<td valign="top">What a sad little photo...I''m gonna give an 8 to the gate.</td>', 'What a sad little photo...I''m gonna give an 8 to the gate.', '2007-01-05 04:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183961, 446585, 6804, '<td valign="top">Awesome !  I love the title as much as the photo!!!  I want to see more of the old truck at the end of the driveway.  I hope you took some shots of it by itself while you were there.  It''s a busy shot, but I like the way it conveys the rural story.</td>', 'Awesome !  I love the title as much as the photo!!!  I want to see more of the old truck at the end of the driveway.  I hope you took some shots of it by itself while you were there.  It''s a busy shot, but I like the way it conveys the rural story.', '2007-01-05 04:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183963, 446381, 62187, '<td valign="top">It''s so bizarre...like an old photo from the 60''s. I like it...8</td>', 'It''s so bizarre...like an old photo from the 60''s. I like it...8', '2007-01-05 04:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183968, 446742, 70000, '<td valign="top">The lighting in this picture is really interesting. I would go for maybe a more creative title but its a cool picture.</td>', 'The lighting in this picture is really interesting. I would go for maybe a more creative title but its a cool picture.', '2007-01-05 04:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183969, 444008, 62187, '<td valign="top">Wow...I like it. Would have been great for the ''Harsh Environment'' challenge too. 9</td>', 'Wow...I like it. Would have been great for the ''Harsh Environment'' challenge too. 9', '2007-01-05 04:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183970, 446491, 6804, '<td valign="top">Dang I love this!!!  This is the kind of work I admire most.  Being able to pull a small portion from the entire scene is an art in itself.  I love the bright orange color in the background and the natural tones in the fence post.  Simply gorgeous. 10</td>', 'Dang I love this!!!  This is the kind of work I admire most.  Being able to pull a small portion from the entire scene is an art in itself.  I love the bright orange color in the background and the natural tones in the fence post.  Simply gorgeous. 10', '2007-01-05 04:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183971, 444637, 62187, '<td valign="top">Wow...that''s some pretty green grass for the winter...anyway...nice photo...8</td>', 'Wow...that''s some pretty green grass for the winter...anyway...nice photo...8', '2007-01-05 04:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183972, 443779, 6804, '<td valign="top">Simply Gorgeous!!!</td>', 'Simply Gorgeous!!!', '2007-01-05 04:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183977, 444786, 6804, '<td valign="top">I love the processing on the bricks and the very slight grunge feel.  Nates at the top of the building is excellent.  I''m glad you didn''t crop it out.  A great shot!!!</td>', 'I love the processing on the bricks and the very slight grunge feel.  Nates at the top of the building is excellent.  I''m glad you didn''t crop it out.  A great shot!!!', '2007-01-05 04:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183988, 445797, 3595, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot!</td>', 'Fantastic shot!', '2007-01-05 04:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183995, 445195, 3595, '<td valign="top">Very good perspective!</td>', 'Very good perspective!', '2007-01-05 04:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183998, 446383, 3595, '<td valign="top">Good eye!</td>', 'Good eye!', '2007-01-05 04:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183999, 445147, 62187, '<td valign="top">Is this like one of those play-houses like at McDonalds but for adults? I can''t imagine what this really is. Nice observation. Sky is kinda grainy. I might have magic-wanded the sky and clouds, reduced noise and gaussian blurred it some. Otherwise...nice silhouette and contrast. It''s an out-of-the-box fence too...bonus points...8</td>', 'Is this like one of those play-houses like at McDonalds but for adults? I can''t imagine what this really is. Nice observation. Sky is kinda grainy. I might have magic-wanded the sky and clouds, reduced noise and gaussian blurred it some. Otherwise...nice silhouette and contrast. It''s an out-of-the-box fence too...bonus points...8', '2007-01-05 04:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3184000, 446609, 6804, '<td valign="top">Making a picture of a fence into something I would hang on my wall is indeed a challenge.  This is good enough to be on a calendar.<br/> <br/>Impressive work!</td>', 'Making a picture of a fence into something I would hang on my wall is indeed a challenge.  This is good enough to be on a calendar. Impressive work!', '2007-01-05 04:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
