(3185106, 446370, 70187, '<td valign="top">The focus is on the part swinging up, but to fit your title more, i think it would have been better to be in focus on the bottom part. Here are roots, branches,.. cluttering the fence so it gives a more chaotic feel, which would be cleared up by the slightly out of focus part of the fence which is still trying to stand straight. That way the impact would come from the cluttered part, which would be stronger in my opinion.<br/> <br/>I very much like your color use.<br/> <br/>vote=6</td>', 'The focus is on the part swinging up, but to fit your title more, i think it would have been better to be in focus on the bottom part. Here are roots, branches,.. cluttering the fence so it gives a more chaotic feel, which would be cleared up by the slightly out of focus part of the fence which is still trying to stand straight. That way the impact would come from the cluttered part, which would be stronger in my opinion. I very much like your color use. vote=6', '2007-01-05 14:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
