(3187276, 445714, 53316, '<td valign="top">I usually like out of the box interpretations, but in my opinion they shouldn''t be in this challenge since the description specifically says "actual, physical fences".  I know it does say "your perspective" but because it says physical fences too, I feel like creativity might have been better spent on finding a way to present a physical fence in an interesting light.<br/> <br/>Please don''t think I''m against out of the box shots (a look at my portfolio should tell you otherwise) - I just feel like this challenge was not the challenge to do it in.  I am boosting you a couple points for such a technically amazing shot, but to be honest you are not getting a good score from me.</td>', 'I usually like out of the box interpretations, but in my opinion they shouldn''t be in this challenge since the description specifically says "actual, physical fences".  I know it does say "your perspective" but because it says physical fences too, I feel like creativity might have been better spent on finding a way to present a physical fence in an interesting light. Please don''t think I''m against out of the box shots (a look at my portfolio should tell you otherwise) - I just feel like this challenge was not the challenge to do it in.  I am boosting you a couple points for such a technically amazing shot, but to be honest you are not getting a good score from me.', '2007-01-06 02:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3187278, 445172, 53316, '<td valign="top">The presence of the letters just MAKES this shot. Very impressive capture.</td>', 'The presence of the letters just MAKES this shot. Very impressive capture.', '2007-01-06 02:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3187325, 444614, 53316, '<td valign="top">Amazing composition.</td>', 'Amazing composition.', '2007-01-06 02:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
