(3188359, 443975, 69034, '<td valign="top">For some reason I love this shot.  Maybe it''s the fact that I''m freezing my huevos off here in the Pacific NW of the USA. . .lol</td>', 'For some reason I love this shot.  Maybe it''s the fact that I''m freezing my huevos off here in the Pacific NW of the USA. . .lol', '2007-01-06 13:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3188360, 445489, 7743, '<td valign="top">There are some interesting textures here and the line of the fence makes a nice curve.  However, I feel you could have exploited the line of the fence better by having it more on a diagonal.</td>', 'There are some interesting textures here and the line of the fence makes a nice curve.  However, I feel you could have exploited the line of the fence better by having it more on a diagonal.', '2007-01-06 13:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3188363, 445495, 66597, '<td valign="top">Lines and color temperature are nice. The hard light draws focus away from wheel, however - it is difficult to identify focal point. Consider re-taking with tripod under cloudy condition and slight light on focal area?</td>', 'Lines and color temperature are nice. The hard light draws focus away from wheel, however - it is difficult to identify focal point. Consider re-taking with tripod under cloudy condition and slight light on focal area?', '2007-01-06 13:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
