(3190796, 444360, 31955, '<td valign="top">I would have liked this more if it were a bit brighter. It makes me wonder what the view is beyond the rocks where the light is coming from and this makes your title work well. 7</td>', 'I would have liked this more if it were a bit brighter. It makes me wonder what the view is beyond the rocks where the light is coming from and this makes your title work well. 7', '2007-01-07 08:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3190872, 446271, 66597, '<td valign="top">I really like this aside from the grainiess on the dog''s face.</td>', 'I really like this aside from the grainiess on the dog''s face.', '2007-01-07 09:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3190874, 445003, 66597, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting!</td>', 'Nice lighting!', '2007-01-07 09:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3190875, 446521, 66597, '<td valign="top">Lines are nice. Reminds me of the area around Butte, Montana near Pipestone Pass. Crisp focus and good long DOF.</td>', 'Lines are nice. Reminds me of the area around Butte, Montana near Pipestone Pass. Crisp focus and good long DOF.', '2007-01-07 09:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3190877, 443360, 66597, '<td valign="top">Is this really Auschwitz? I imagine it must be very difficult to visit. As a photo I think the fenceline is very strong, especially as it intersects with the canal. I would consider cropping a bit off right-hand side so that the merging point is more in the "two-thirds" position. The sky is also blown in places, though I don''t think that hurts you too much here. 7.</td>', 'Is this really Auschwitz? I imagine it must be very difficult to visit. As a photo I think the fenceline is very strong, especially as it intersects with the canal. I would consider cropping a bit off right-hand side so that the merging point is more in the "two-thirds" position. The sky is also blown in places, though I don''t think that hurts you too much here. 7.', '2007-01-07 09:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3190878, 446070, 66597, '<td valign="top">Although I think this photo could be stronger technically (a bit better lighting in foreground and tighter crop), it is very, very creative. 7.</td>', 'Although I think this photo could be stronger technically (a bit better lighting in foreground and tighter crop), it is very, very creative. 7.', '2007-01-07 09:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3190882, 446656, 66597, '<td valign="top">The line is very strong to vanishing point in this photo. There is one major detractant - the horizontal airplane trail at the top, which takes focus away from the fence. I think it would be much stronger if the trail were partially cropped out. 7.</td>', 'The line is very strong to vanishing point in this photo. There is one major detractant - the horizontal airplane trail at the top, which takes focus away from the fence. I think it would be much stronger if the trail were partially cropped out. 7.', '2007-01-07 09:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3190883, 446556, 66597, '<td valign="top">Beautiful starburst!</td>', 'Beautiful starburst!', '2007-01-07 09:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3190884, 446372, 66597, '<td valign="top">Great emotive. Like the color treatment you chose in PP.</td>', 'Great emotive. Like the color treatment you chose in PP.', '2007-01-07 09:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3190887, 446365, 66597, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors. If there were just a bit more breathing room at photo top (trees not cut off) this would be an 8 from me. Very nice effort, and great fences. 7.</td>', 'Lovely colors. If there were just a bit more breathing room at photo top (trees not cut off) this would be an 8 from me. Very nice effort, and great fences. 7.', '2007-01-07 09:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3190889, 444594, 66597, '<td valign="top">Great capture of the tracks, fence and shadow. 7.</td>', 'Great capture of the tracks, fence and shadow. 7.', '2007-01-07 09:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3190891, 446758, 66597, '<td valign="top">Stunning colors and great perspective. 7.</td>', 'Stunning colors and great perspective. 7.', '2007-01-07 09:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
