(3197827, 446654, 51538, '<td valign="top">In Australia?  I lived there for a while in my youth in the early 60s of the last century.  At that time, we kept tropical fish.  My father was a doctor and  we always used to get our fish from a man who had a tremendous garden with ponds, some alligators, and an outhouse with many tanks of tropical fish.  I always remember my visits with my father to his place.  He was quite a character.  He dug his own well in the garden, by hand.  He almost killed himself when he put his hand into a tank container a full size electric eel.  But there was a sad ending to that story and for his family.  His full time job was as prison guard.  Apparently, during his shift there was an escape.  He took this to heart and shot himself.  One of my earliest recollections of death.  My father, the doctor was always called out in such occasions.  Your photo reminds me.</td>', 'In Australia?  I lived there for a while in my youth in the early 60s of the last century.  At that time, we kept tropical fish.  My father was a doctor and  we always used to get our fish from a man who had a tremendous garden with ponds, some alligators, and an outhouse with many tanks of tropical fish.  I always remember my visits with my father to his place.  He was quite a character.  He dug his own well in the garden, by hand.  He almost killed himself when he put his hand into a tank container a full size electric eel.  But there was a sad ending to that story and for his family.  His full time job was as prison guard.  Apparently, during his shift there was an escape.  He took this to heart and shot himself.  One of my earliest recollections of death.  My father, the doctor was always called out in such occasions.  Your photo reminds me.', '2007-01-08 20:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3197936, 446654, 71656, '<td valign="top">nice one Scotty boy</td>', 'nice one Scotty boy', '2007-01-08 21:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3197948, 444952, 71656, '<td valign="top">I love this photo. Well done!</td>', 'I love this photo. Well done!', '2007-01-08 21:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
