(3200898, 445338, 71060, '<td valign="top">The fence is very cool, but I wish you had done something more with it. The angle is odd and not really appealing, but I know that can be hard to control. I feel like the solid white background detracts. I want an environment to picture this in, but there is no clue.</td>', 'The fence is very cool, but I wish you had done something more with it. The angle is odd and not really appealing, but I know that can be hard to control. I feel like the solid white background detracts. I want an environment to picture this in, but there is no clue.', '2007-01-09 15:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
