(3200927, 444826, 71060, '<td valign="top">The curve of this fence might have been very nice if you had gotten up closer and taken it from a different angel, with more focus on the fence itself. Its also way washed out.</td>', 'The curve of this fence might have been very nice if you had gotten up closer and taken it from a different angel, with more focus on the fence itself. Its also way washed out.', '2007-01-09 15:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3200928, 446065, 47916, '<td valign="top">nice shot :)</td>', 'nice shot :)', '2007-01-09 15:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3200929, 446402, 47916, '<td valign="top">nice shot :)</td>', 'nice shot :)', '2007-01-09 15:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3200978, 446531, 71060, '<td valign="top">The content and quality of the exposure here is great. The color editing seems way harsh to me. The horse looks unnaturally red and I would like to see some color in the sky.</td>', 'The content and quality of the exposure here is great. The color editing seems way harsh to me. The horse looks unnaturally red and I would like to see some color in the sky.', '2007-01-09 15:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3200979, 445401, 71060, '<td valign="top">I feel like the angle is a little too extreme, but I love the message and the color is nice.</td>', 'I feel like the angle is a little too extreme, but I love the message and the color is nice.', '2007-01-09 15:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3200981, 445093, 71060, '<td valign="top">I wish the parts outside the main focus weren''t so blurry. I love the hint of falling snow.</td>', 'I wish the parts outside the main focus weren''t so blurry. I love the hint of falling snow.', '2007-01-09 15:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3200987, 444880, 71060, '<td valign="top">The content is great. I''m sure you''ve been told its too dark, and I think a longer exposure would have m,ade for the beautiful color that this is lacking.</td>', 'The content is great. I''m sure you''ve been told its too dark, and I think a longer exposure would have m,ade for the beautiful color that this is lacking.', '2007-01-09 15:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3200990, 444937, 71239, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, great expression and good depth of field control.  Maybe the face needs a touch more light on the right hand side or possibly the lightest fill-in flash to get the highlight in the eyes and to bring the dress forward in the picture.  My main concern is that given the challange subject, the child is most important element of this photo and the fence is somewhat secondary.</td>', 'Nice composition, great expression and good depth of field control.  Maybe the face needs a touch more light on the right hand side or possibly the lightest fill-in flash to get the highlight in the eyes and to bring the dress forward in the picture.  My main concern is that given the challange subject, the child is most important element of this photo and the fence is somewhat secondary.', '2007-01-09 16:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201025, 445794, 71239, '<td valign="top">Well spotted image.  It''s almost a pattern shot (rectangular fence posts versus the curves of the plant).  A shade less depth of field to blur the backround greenery perhaps?</td>', 'Well spotted image.  It''s almost a pattern shot (rectangular fence posts versus the curves of the plant).  A shade less depth of field to blur the backround greenery perhaps?', '2007-01-09 16:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201028, 446581, 71060, '<td valign="top">I wish that this reached the full allowable size.</td>', 'I wish that this reached the full allowable size.', '2007-01-09 16:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201059, 444653, 71239, '<td valign="top">Great winter scene and just a pity that the sun wasn''t just bit bit further ''round so that it highlighted the front of the fence posts. It''s never in the right place for me either - if it ever comes out at all!</td>', 'Great winter scene and just a pity that the sun wasn''t just bit bit further ''round so that it highlighted the front of the fence posts. It''s never in the right place for me either - if it ever comes out at all!', '2007-01-09 16:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201081, 446718, 71239, '<td valign="top">Nice idea - but having the strong colour at the top tends to drag my eye there, rather than to the interesting fence pattern.</td>', 'Nice idea - but having the strong colour at the top tends to drag my eye there, rather than to the interesting fence pattern.', '2007-01-09 16:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201089, 446383, 66654, '<td valign="top">Awesome! I like the icicles on the wire. The detail is sharp.</td>', 'Awesome! I like the icicles on the wire. The detail is sharp.', '2007-01-09 16:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201093, 443763, 66654, '<td valign="top">I like how you can travel up the fence to the mountains. It''s like a path. I like the colors.</td>', 'I like how you can travel up the fence to the mountains. It''s like a path. I like the colors.', '2007-01-09 16:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201105, 446139, 66654, '<td valign="top">I like this photo because it is very beautiful. Colors are good too. But the sun is too bright. It looks like a big white blob.</td>', 'I like this photo because it is very beautiful. Colors are good too. But the sun is too bright. It looks like a big white blob.', '2007-01-09 16:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201111, 445714, 71239, '<td valign="top">Nicely lit and shot - but the challenge does say that it refers to physical, actual fences so maybe the image has strayed away from the subject set?</td>', 'Nicely lit and shot - but the challenge does say that it refers to physical, actual fences so maybe the image has strayed away from the subject set?', '2007-01-09 16:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201118, 446351, 71239, '<td valign="top">Nice, bleak cityscape - the razor wire is essential to set the mood.</td>', 'Nice, bleak cityscape - the razor wire is essential to set the mood.', '2007-01-09 16:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201128, 446531, 71581, '<td valign="top">Maybe would have just done the barn in colour, but nice composure.</td>', 'Maybe would have just done the barn in colour, but nice composure.', '2007-01-09 16:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201132, 445228, 71239, '<td valign="top">I''d never have thought of doing a negative image to make the unlit side of a fence and the shadow into focal points.  Very creative.</td>', 'I''d never have thought of doing a negative image to make the unlit side of a fence and the shadow into focal points.  Very creative.', '2007-01-09 16:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201133, 445308, 66654, '<td valign="top">I like the colors in this photo. This is a pretty winter scene. 8</td>', 'I like the colors in this photo. This is a pretty winter scene. 8', '2007-01-09 16:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201163, 446674, 18586, '<td valign="top">More composition required</td>', 'More composition required', '2007-01-09 16:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201165, 444256, 71239, '<td valign="top">It''s a bit distracting to have two distinct areas in focus - I find my eye jumping from the cable to the wood on the left and back.  Perhaps changing the focal plane so it aligns more with the cable might help?</td>', 'It''s a bit distracting to have two distinct areas in focus - I find my eye jumping from the cable to the wood on the left and back.  Perhaps changing the focal plane so it aligns more with the cable might help?', '2007-01-09 16:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201175, 445670, 18586, '<td valign="top">Sky not right</td>', 'Sky not right', '2007-01-09 16:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
