(3201298, 444008, 71239, '<td valign="top">I think that the two main elements (Elk and fence) are too independent of each other here, so that the fence isn''t really appearing to restrain the Elk.  I can see why you went for the shot though - misty images of Elk coming from the forest has potential.</td>', 'I think that the two main elements (Elk and fence) are too independent of each other here, so that the fence isn''t really appearing to restrain the Elk.  I can see why you went for the shot though - misty images of Elk coming from the forest has potential.', '2007-01-09 17:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
