(3201652, 444263, 70375, '<td valign="top">WOW! LOOK HOW DEFINED THAT FENCE IS!! I don''t mean to yell but this is a killer photograph!!! I also don''t usually tell scores in the comments but this is a TEN if I ever saw one :D</td>', 'WOW! LOOK HOW DEFINED THAT FENCE IS!! I don''t mean to yell but this is a killer photograph!!! I also don''t usually tell scores in the comments but this is a TEN if I ever saw one :D', '2007-01-09 19:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201658, 446381, 70375, '<td valign="top">Too small too oof</td>', 'Too small too oof', '2007-01-09 19:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201669, 446256, 50695, '<td valign="top">I think this is my blue ribbon. This is like a chess game played on the edge of self, and I''m looking three moves ahead. 10</td>', 'I think this is my blue ribbon. This is like a chess game played on the edge of self, and I''m looking three moves ahead. 10', '2007-01-09 19:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201678, 445743, 50695, '<td valign="top">I hate landscapes, but this is captivating. It''s got a nice sense of layers. The foreground layer, the one with the fence, is dark and mysterious, but with a gorgeous sheen on the water. Then a sort of dull emerald in the middle layer, which is exotically distant, and finally the surreal pink sky. A real pleasure to look at. Also horizontal bands of darkness give this a unified feel. What a composition. 10</td>', 'I hate landscapes, but this is captivating. It''s got a nice sense of layers. The foreground layer, the one with the fence, is dark and mysterious, but with a gorgeous sheen on the water. Then a sort of dull emerald in the middle layer, which is exotically distant, and finally the surreal pink sky. A real pleasure to look at. Also horizontal bands of darkness give this a unified feel. What a composition. 10', '2007-01-09 19:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201685, 444363, 50695, '<td valign="top">Great title for an intriguing portrait. The man has stage presence! and the fence suggests a theme that he might be pondering, a sense of his limits, within and without. 9</td>', 'Great title for an intriguing portrait. The man has stage presence! and the fence suggests a theme that he might be pondering, a sense of his limits, within and without. 9', '2007-01-09 19:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201688, 446417, 50695, '<td valign="top">my impulse is to go EEK and drop this photo, because it looks so corporate, but it is what it is and does it masterfully. and ultimately it is too quirky to be truly corporate... like there is a story hidden here. 9</td>', 'my impulse is to go EEK and drop this photo, because it looks so corporate, but it is what it is and does it masterfully. and ultimately it is too quirky to be truly corporate... like there is a story hidden here. 9', '2007-01-09 19:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
