(3201736, 446553, 15413, '<td valign="top">I do not normally like fences and other things in the foreground, however, I think you have done a wonderful job of incorporating the fences into this image. They are an integral part of and make the subject that mutch more interesting. Very good job!</td>', 'I do not normally like fences and other things in the foreground, however, I think you have done a wonderful job of incorporating the fences into this image. They are an integral part of and make the subject that mutch more interesting. Very good job!', '2007-01-09 20:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201744, 446347, 15413, '<td valign="top">A very nice photo that is potentially very interesting. I like the rustic feel, and the use of the visual elements, however I don''t like the big white space in the top left of the image. I would probably back up and use a zoom to try and put more trees in that space.</td>', 'A very nice photo that is potentially very interesting. I like the rustic feel, and the use of the visual elements, however I don''t like the big white space in the top left of the image. I would probably back up and use a zoom to try and put more trees in that space.', '2007-01-09 20:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201755, 446615, 15413, '<td valign="top">I really like this. I love the tonal range (and the use of black &amp; white) and the fact that the focus is sharp in the center only. Very nice job.</td>', 'I really like this. I love the tonal range (and the use of black & white) and the fact that the focus is sharp in the center only. Very nice job.', '2007-01-09 20:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3201762, 446566, 15413, '<td valign="top">I think I would prefer the posts to be upright and the image to be cropped vertically instead. I think the use of B&amp;W was good and I like the use of focus.</td>', 'I think I would prefer the posts to be upright and the image to be cropped vertically instead. I think the use of B&W was good and I like the use of focus.', '2007-01-09 20:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
