(3201795, 446080, 15413, '<td valign="top">I like this. I had to look at it for a while but it get''s me. The use of B&amp;W was a good choice, and the depth of field is good. I think a bit more depth would be nice but the haze over such a distance is difficult to deal with.</td>', 'I like this. I had to look at it for a while but it get''s me. The use of B&W was a good choice, and the depth of field is good. I think a bit more depth would be nice but the haze over such a distance is difficult to deal with.', '2007-01-09 20:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
