(3202118, 445762, 55822, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot, has a cold feeling to it, but not in such a way as to make the viewer not like it. My only gripe is the border, I would rather have seen it stay the same on all sides. the way it is distracts from the image itself.</td>', 'Amazing shot, has a cold feeling to it, but not in such a way as to make the viewer not like it. My only gripe is the border, I would rather have seen it stay the same on all sides. the way it is distracts from the image itself.', '2007-01-09 21:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
