(3202120, 446417, 67404, '<td valign="top">Not my favorite photo in this group but something about it made me look at it a second and third time.  Perhaps it is the nice color contrast with the yellow tie.  Also enjoy the mans shadow on the wall behind him.  The tie makes him seem bold and the shadow makes him seem small &amp; unsure.  Interesting.</td>', 'Not my favorite photo in this group but something about it made me look at it a second and third time.  Perhaps it is the nice color contrast with the yellow tie.  Also enjoy the mans shadow on the wall behind him.  The tie makes him seem bold and the shadow makes him seem small & unsure.  Interesting.', '2007-01-09 21:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3202122, 446681, 42013, '<td valign="top">BRrrr. I''d probably prefer less of an angle to the horizon line.</td>', 'BRrrr. I''d probably prefer less of an angle to the horizon line.', '2007-01-09 21:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
