(3202157, 445671, 67404, '<td valign="top">I quickly jumped pass this shot giving it a low score.  (didn''t much care for the green coloring) But as I clicked on the number I saw the ''echo'' of the man in the middle.  That made me go back and take a closer look.  Then I noticed that perhaps there are two people in the ''echo'' working on something.  I love pictures that make me wonder what the story is and this one definatly does that.  Nice job.</td>', 'I quickly jumped pass this shot giving it a low score.  (didn''t much care for the green coloring) But as I clicked on the number I saw the ''echo'' of the man in the middle.  That made me go back and take a closer look.  Then I noticed that perhaps there are two people in the ''echo'' working on something.  I love pictures that make me wonder what the story is and this one definatly does that.  Nice job.', '2007-01-09 22:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
