(3202172, 445714, 42013, '<td valign="top">The challenge description seemed to beg a more literal interpretation of ''fence'' but hopefully your ootb rendering isn''t hurting you too much. I like the idea and the only real nitpic i have is the contrsat between the bricks and the lines of tape. To me the floor overpowers the picture and draws attention away from the girl. That said, your lighting is nice and well controlled.</td>', 'The challenge description seemed to beg a more literal interpretation of ''fence'' but hopefully your ootb rendering isn''t hurting you too much. I like the idea and the only real nitpic i have is the contrsat between the bricks and the lines of tape. To me the floor overpowers the picture and draws attention away from the girl. That said, your lighting is nice and well controlled.', '2007-01-09 22:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
