(3202521, 446607, 29011, '<td valign="top">A very cool find! I like the perspective. The shot has very nice color and contrast. The only nitpick is I see a hint of the post there as if you where trying to remove it? Would leave it there for realism but on the other hand, let the imagination go wild ;) I guess some folks didnt look close enough and didn''t see the post and asked this shot be validated. I''m glad you passed :)</td>', 'A very cool find! I like the perspective. The shot has very nice color and contrast. The only nitpick is I see a hint of the post there as if you where trying to remove it? Would leave it there for realism but on the other hand, let the imagination go wild ;) I guess some folks didnt look close enough and didn''t see the post and asked this shot be validated. I''m glad you passed :)', '2007-01-09 23:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
