(3202654, 446469, 66348, '<td valign="top">Love your angle and composition. Colors in the sky are incredible also. Also nice DOF. Nice work.</td>', 'Love your angle and composition. Colors in the sky are incredible also. Also nice DOF. Nice work.', '2007-01-09 23:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3202656, 445003, 65025, '<td valign="top">The fence serves as a nice leading line through the photo.  There seems to be a funny black cloud around your trees, not sure if that was from post processing or not.  Also, it might look nicer with all of the sky on top cropped off.  But a very nice photo.  the colors work well together.  7</td>', 'The fence serves as a nice leading line through the photo.  There seems to be a funny black cloud around your trees, not sure if that was from post processing or not.  Also, it might look nicer with all of the sky on top cropped off.  But a very nice photo.  the colors work well together.  7', '2007-01-09 23:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3202661, 446693, 66348, '<td valign="top">Great colors and angle of your shot. Lighting is awesome and the moon in the background looks great. Nice work.</td>', 'Great colors and angle of your shot. Lighting is awesome and the moon in the background looks great. Nice work.', '2007-01-09 23:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3202668, 443557, 65025, '<td valign="top">GREAT use of contrasting subjects.  It kind of reminds of John Pfahl''s <a href="//johnpfahl.com/pages/powerplaceseast/eastwestpowerplacemenu.html" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">"Power Places"</a> series.  The selective desaturation also works well.<br/>The one thing I''d like to see is less on the left, so that the smoke, or other point of interest, is more at 1/3 of the frame.  Nice.  8</td>', 'GREAT use of contrasting subjects.  It kind of reminds of John Pfahl''s "Power Places" series.  The selective desaturation also works well.The one thing I''d like to see is less on the left, so that the smoke, or other point of interest, is more at 1/3 of the frame.  Nice.  8', '2007-01-09 23:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3202676, 446278, 65025, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, and a great range.  I kind of want to see more contrast though.  7</td>', 'Nice lighting, and a great range.  I kind of want to see more contrast though.  7', '2007-01-09 23:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3202693, 444976, 69407, '<td valign="top">This is a little bit dark, but the purple cast is really intriguing!</td>', 'This is a little bit dark, but the purple cast is really intriguing!', '2007-01-09 23:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3202696, 446651, 65025, '<td valign="top">The mixture of different light colors gives it a nice feel.</td>', 'The mixture of different light colors gives it a nice feel.', '2007-01-09 23:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3202697, 446504, 69407, '<td valign="top">The grass is so vibrant in this photo! It makes everything else look a little washed out, but it''s a very striking affect.</td>', 'The grass is so vibrant in this photo! It makes everything else look a little washed out, but it''s a very striking affect.', '2007-01-09 23:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3202703, 444933, 65025, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, and the texture on the wood is great.</td>', 'Great lighting, and the texture on the wood is great.', '2007-01-09 23:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3202708, 445725, 69407, '<td valign="top">A very close shot - a very nice affect! A little more detail would have been really nice. The colors are wonderful - it seems so cold!</td>', 'A very close shot - a very nice affect! A little more detail would have been really nice. The colors are wonderful - it seems so cold!', '2007-01-09 23:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3202715, 444500, 69407, '<td valign="top">This is such a sharp photo - the contast makes the detail really stand out. This is a beautiful fence/sculpture - the sunlight at the end of it really makes it stand out more more than at the front of the picture.</td>', 'This is such a sharp photo - the contast makes the detail really stand out. This is a beautiful fence/sculpture - the sunlight at the end of it really makes it stand out more more than at the front of the picture.', '2007-01-09 23:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3202721, 443815, 69407, '<td valign="top">I love cemetary shots! The natural focus is the front of the headstones, but the angle you''ve used is obviously the focus for the fence - more appropriate, but I think it creates a little discomfort here. The difference between the vibrant color in the sky and the ground is really evocative, though.</td>', 'I love cemetary shots! The natural focus is the front of the headstones, but the angle you''ve used is obviously the focus for the fence - more appropriate, but I think it creates a little discomfort here. The difference between the vibrant color in the sky and the ground is really evocative, though.', '2007-01-09 23:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
