(3204479, 446518, 45549, '<td valign="top">Beautifull capture. I like it that the angle is from below, I believe this works very well with small kids.<br/> <br/>The small finger of the little girl''s right hand annoys me a bit. I also think a small black border or a bit tighter crop to get rid of the small black line on the top of the photograph would be nice. And I believe under advanced editing the spot editing of the small imperfections on the fence is allowed.<br/></td>', 'Beautifull capture. I like it that the angle is from below, I believe this works very well with small kids. The small finger of the little girl''s right hand annoys me a bit. I also think a small black border or a bit tighter crop to get rid of the small black line on the top of the photograph would be nice. And I believe under advanced editing the spot editing of the small imperfections on the fence is allowed.', '2007-01-10 06:42:40.000000', NULL, 0),
