(3204599, 445210, 23484, '<td valign="top">Julianne, I didn''t vote in this challenge but if I did, this would have received a 7.  I love the color that you gave it.  It works so well.  I thought a shot like this would be in the 6''s.</td>', 'Julianne, I didn''t vote in this challenge but if I did, this would have received a 7.  I love the color that you gave it.  It works so well.  I thought a shot like this would be in the 6''s.', '2007-01-10 07:22:04.000000', NULL, 0),
