(3204803, 446402, 20941, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your top ten and personal best! Love the perspective, I took similar shots from this angle, but it was kinda windy and got sand in my teeth, my lens, my shoes, lost my cell phone and my gloves (found them later) so I decided to stay upright! Nice work!</td>', 'Congratulations on your top ten and personal best! Love the perspective, I took similar shots from this angle, but it was kinda windy and got sand in my teeth, my lens, my shoes, lost my cell phone and my gloves (found them later) so I decided to stay upright! Nice work!', '2007-01-10 08:32:42.000000', NULL, 0),
