(3205035, 444670, 60805, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your high finish les. I crashed of course, <br/>because DNMC. Due to little cultural difference here, we call soft and hard barriers fences. Such as concrete fence.<br/> <br/>No excuse, but just the way we speak. Still coming 4 u (grinning :))</td>', 'Congrats on your high finish les. I crashed of course, because DNMC. Due to little cultural difference here, we call soft and hard barriers fences. Such as concrete fence. No excuse, but just the way we speak. Still coming 4 u (grinning :))', '2007-01-10 09:02:23.000000', NULL, 0),
