(3205335, 446400, 24454, '<td valign="top">I think its pretty wow, myself!  I love the way the pink tones in the church bring out those rich reddish tones in the rusty fence.  I love it!<br/> <br/></td>', 'I think its pretty wow, myself!  I love the way the pink tones in the church bring out those rich reddish tones in the rusty fence.  I love it! ', '2007-01-10 09:39:58.000000', NULL, 0),
