(3205647, 446553, 51538, '<td valign="top">Congratulations, Charmayne.  Heck, although you''re doing nice things for New York and Brooklyn, you''re showing us other NYers up.  Darn it. ;-)  Manhattan Beach is one of the nicest, is it not.  I hear it is Russian Mafia these days.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-01-10 10:47:09.</i></td>', 'Congratulations, Charmayne.  Heck, although you''re doing nice things for New York and Brooklyn, you''re showing us other NYers up.  Darn it. ;-)  Manhattan Beach is one of the nicest, is it not.  I hear it is Russian Mafia these days.', '2007-01-10 10:45:49.000000', '2007-01-10 10:47:09.000000', 0),
