(3207515, 446328, 15711, '<td valign="top">I liked this so much.  Glad it did well! Congrats.</td>', 'I liked this so much.  Glad it did well! Congrats.', '2007-01-10 15:54:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(3207612, 446365, 29293, '<td valign="top">i didnt vote on this one but the tones are wonderful.</td>', 'i didnt vote on this one but the tones are wonderful.', '2007-01-10 16:10:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(3207631, 446504, 29591, '<td valign="top">I agree about the tighter crop. I am using a lap-top''s monitor so take the comments accordingly :) the cows look great but for some overcast light on their backs (not a real problem there). About the sky, yes, it is quite distracting, there are different ways to sort that out specially if you are shooting RAW. Here a useful tutorian on <a href="//www.luminous-landscape.com/tutorials/digital-blending.shtml" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">blending exposures</a></td>', 'I agree about the tighter crop. I am using a lap-top''s monitor so take the comments accordingly :) the cows look great but for some overcast light on their backs (not a real problem there). About the sky, yes, it is quite distracting, there are different ways to sort that out specially if you are shooting RAW. Here a useful tutorian on blending exposures', '2007-01-10 16:13:19.000000', NULL, 0),
