(3208594, 444774, 48890, '<td valign="top">That "thing" and its shadow are a *great* find, I love them.  The texture that fills the rest of the frame is also nice.  But, somehow, this picture is not working for me.  Perhaps it''s the strange compositional decision of placing the wire thing into the mid-top part of the photo.</td>', 'That "thing" and its shadow are a *great* find, I love them.  The texture that fills the rest of the frame is also nice.  But, somehow, this picture is not working for me.  Perhaps it''s the strange compositional decision of placing the wire thing into the mid-top part of the photo.', '2007-01-10 18:53:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(3208634, 445181, 48890, '<td valign="top">"Too dark" - I love those easy-to-expect comments.  Tune your monitors, people, there''s plenty of detail in this image.<br/> <br/>As for the image, I think that I see why you wanted to photograph this.  But, to me, this isn''t working compositionally.  I cannot articulate what I don''t like about it, though - it''s very hard in this kind of images.</td>', '"Too dark" - I love those easy-to-expect comments.  Tune your monitors, people, there''s plenty of detail in this image. As for the image, I think that I see why you wanted to photograph this.  But, to me, this isn''t working compositionally.  I cannot articulate what I don''t like about it, though - it''s very hard in this kind of images.', '2007-01-10 19:03:16.000000', NULL, 0),
