(3208929, 444739, 50695, '<td valign="top">No no no, please keep thinking of art. Do it for me. Screw the scores. Make me happy! You evoke Man Ray with this shot. I hate the thought of another poetic soul diminished by the DPC grinder.</td>', 'No no no, please keep thinking of art. Do it for me. Screw the scores. Make me happy! You evoke Man Ray with this shot. I hate the thought of another poetic soul diminished by the DPC grinder.', '2007-01-10 20:04:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(3209053, 444310, 62642, '<td valign="top">Well, it''s not a picture of "nothing"...what kind of comment is that?<br/> <br/>Anyway, I don''t like this picture either, I had submitted late one night, and then decided I had a much better one, but for some reason forgot to make the change.  Not surprised at this low score at all....I like to use graininess and I love black and white, but this, I know.  Blech.</td>', 'Well, it''s not a picture of "nothing"...what kind of comment is that? Anyway, I don''t like this picture either, I had submitted late one night, and then decided I had a much better one, but for some reason forgot to make the change.  Not surprised at this low score at all....I like to use graininess and I love black and white, but this, I know.  Blech.', '2007-01-10 20:23:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(3209192, 446005, 35297, '<td valign="top">When I submitted this, I was thinking about the humor value of a missing fence and a Tiger licking it''s lips.  I guess I should have submitted the other version, which has the fence in, with a caption "Thank Goodness for Fences".<br/> <br/>The fence on the tiger compound was removed by using a very tight DOF.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-01-10 20:50:14.</i></td>', 'When I submitted this, I was thinking about the humor value of a missing fence and a Tiger licking it''s lips.  I guess I should have submitted the other version, which has the fence in, with a caption "Thank Goodness for Fences". The fence on the tiger compound was removed by using a very tight DOF.', '2007-01-10 20:49:44.000000', '2007-01-10 20:50:14.000000', 0),
