(3210909, 444622, 24486, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by HerbCSO:</b></div><hr/><i> Are those daleks? ;] </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>No, but you did get a laugh out of me when I read your comment. I''m a Dr Who fan too<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by shoggy:</b></div><hr/><i> what are those cilindric things? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Fence posts<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-01-11 05:40:12.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by HerbCSO: Are those daleks? ;]   No, but you did get a laugh out of me when I read your comment. I''m a Dr Who fan too Originally posted by shoggy: what are those cilindric things?   Fence posts', '2007-01-11 05:39:24.000000', '2007-01-11 05:40:12.000000', 0),
